    <Placemark>
      <name>Englandshverir</name>
      <description><![CDATA[With no changing facilities available, come prepared for this excursion. Latest info: There is still a little warmth in the old pool, but not enough to bathe. A lot of vegetation in the pool because this is the ideal temperature for him. Above the old pool is the stream that flows into it, the stream is very hot and becomes unbearably hot near the hot springs/spring. To get to the pool you have to climb over the tube or wade the river.

Commentaire: Style: icon:1811,color:0288D1

Altitude: 0.0m]]></description>
