    <Placemark>
      <name>Hveragil</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Hveragil geothermal area is about 10 km east of the Kverkfjöll mountain hut. over a stretch of around 2 km, hveragil has numerous hot springs measuring 40-60°C, making them ideal for winter bathing. Can only be accessed by 4x4 mountain vehicles or book your tour with a profesional guide.
