      <name>Ásgarðslaug</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/asgardslaug/ Opening hours: Weekdays: 06:30 – 22:00 Saturdays and Sundays: 08:00 – 22:00 Ásgarðslaug is an outdoor swimming pool with hot tubs and a children's pool. A small water slide is in the children's pool. The pool was recently renovated with new outdoor showers and hot tubs. There is also now a cold tub. Price: - 640 ISK/adult - 160 ISK/children 11-17 years old - Free for children 0-10 years old
