    <Placemark>
      <name>Ásvallalaug</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/frettir/lokad-i-asvallalaug-helgina-8-10-november/ Opening hours: Mondays – Thursdays: 06:30 – 22:00 Fridays: 06:30 – 20:00 Saturdays: 08:00 – 18:00 Sundays: 08:00 – 17:00 Ásvallalaug was first opened in 2008. The swim center is one of the biggest in Iceland, about 6.000 m². In the same building is a Reebok Fitness gym, Ásmegin physiotherapy, the swimming club Sundfélag Hafnarfjarðar and the sport club Fjörður. The sport center is a 50 meter long swimming pool that is usually divided with a bridge so that half of the pool is 25 meters and half is 50 meters. There is also a 17 meter children´s pool that is 0,9 – 1,1 meters deep. Then there is another children´s pool that is about 10 meters big for the youngest children with toys. The temperature is 32°C in the children´s pools and 28°C in the swimming pool. The indoor temperature is around 30°C. There are three hot tubs indoors and two outdoors as well as a water slide and sauna. Price: - 600 ISK/ adult - 140 ISK/children 6-17 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQdxqqFn3SLZkbl01GFsr-af5ztIpMlNXLhf9N9LYaZAsGRso9W3dCQH8W1HC20x2DtxTpScr3V9dTM2IrpAah8wVdTZBhFMoPuDMCS91bkoFB6xMNuzgMuu1gIcjiqw3RBzI0X95c3oodu69baW0cGPGfAeaUcKLtns0IeRRw0kA3GmsHSTf5pcq6lUI0H3zmCckIuiTwJNXaP3CmdND98T6B733JNbY9D517KPpcALao9oeaTMpbQbh4?authuser=0&fife=s16383
