      <name>Sundlaug Breiðholts</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/sundlaugasafn/breidholtslaug-2/ Opening hours: Weekdays: 06:30 – 22:00 Weekends: 09:00 – 22:00 The swimming pool in Breiðholt is a 25 x 12,5 meters big outdoor pool. There are 5 lanes and the temperature is 29°C. There is also a smaller indoor pool that is 12,5 x 8 meters with a temperature of 30°C. There is also two hot tubs, a children's pool and a sauna. There is a 10 meter long water slide. Price: - 980 ISK/ adult - 160 ISK/children 6-17 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
