      <name>Grafarvogslaug Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/sundlaugasafn/grafarvogslaug-2/ Opening hours: Weekdays: 06:30 – 22:00 Weekends: 09:00 – 22:00 Grafarvogur swimming pool was first opened in 1998 and in the years to follow some facilities were added to the pool. There is now an indoor pool, outdoor pool, children's pool and hot tubs. There is also a water slides as well as a children's water slide. Price: - 980 ISK/ adult - 160 ISK/children 6-17 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
