    <Placemark>
      <name>Klébergslaug</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/sundlaugasafn/klebergslaug/ Opening hours: Summer opening 8. June to 21. August: Mondays – Thursdays: 11:00 – 22:00 Fridays: 11:00 – 19:00 Weekends: 11:00 – 18:00 Winter opening, 22. August to 7. June Mondays – Thursdays: 15:00 – 22:00 Fridays: 15:00 – 22:00 Weekends: 11:00 – 15:00 Klébergs swimming pool is located in the sports center in Kjalarnes. It is next to highway number 1 in a beautiful surroundings. It is located by the sea shore with a view out to the ocean. Close by are facilities for sea swimming for those daring enough. Price: - 980 ISK/ adult - 160 ISK/children 7-17 years old - Free for children 0-6 years old
