    <Placemark>
      <name>Suðurbæjarlaug</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/sudurbaejarlaug-2/ Opening hours: Mondays – Thursdays: 06:30 – 22:00 Fridays: 06:30 – 20:00 Saturdays: 08:00 – 18:00 Sundays: 08:00 – 17:00 Suðurbæjarlaug swimming pool is a 12,5 x 25 meter big outdoor pool. It is connected to an indoor pool that is used for teaching and for children. Outside are also hot tubs, steam bath, children's pool, two water slides and a walking path around the swimming pool area. Price: - 600 ISK/ adult - 140 ISK/children 6-17 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRUuSQbxrJC2y1cIP2g6xjG5WwOrzCsTTXKPYzjw2B-6YEaydN0mAm3mKY2DgjEahe7GVSFrUY84aNX5F1elFDN8c6UzSt-M4t6zuuXhtVeiBBix0hbX-bYxreUE7YRqHFWkYqZssJALWX9Jhuw02xDbFlQmOblBPOPWpKWzQgk4uuB1T-sP3_ar3zH-8XbXDgUregq_kIzYQYtKJHxDIyaS1hv-jg_3coJq0BqNwUh4c8fajrd2cP3hhU?authuser=0&fife=s16383
