    <Placemark>
      <name>Sundhöll Reykjavíkur</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/sundholl-reykjavikur/ Opening hours: Weekdays: 06:30 – 22:00 Weekends: 08:00 – 22:00 The swimming pool in an indoor pool, 25 x 10 meters big. There are 4 lanes that are 4 – 9 meters deep. The pool was built between 1929 – 1937 and its architect is the acclaimed Guðjón Samúelsson, State Architect of Iceland. There are two outdoor hot tubs, one is 37 – 39°C and the other is 40 – 42°C. There are two diving boards. The lower is about 1 meter from the surface and the higher is 2,75 meters. Price: - 980 ISK/ adult - 160 ISK/children 6-17 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQ1zGZBV664VUsLCTt535U1QOdq60omSW-r1zOzdcFgWkai6iYHIPD80qFq9mFIJeb6kqJ168FpJqiOCdooNfpGNlpqNq-ilkNdAxxIMWSMq_QvQrBUEsGwLbD9UvM-DDX5P_AwvcrmZZKHroypeaedngtX_mabBk11BvEv_0cYQCgmxg7jv0mtnp_hjKY6BDSZHQo02_2pk-NdxjS52xJB69Vg5AzD1FAkvwQ4z2Afq8QDjEpPtsIgSeg?authuser=0&fife=s16383
