    <Placemark>
      <name>Sundlaugin í Kópavogi (Kópavogslaug)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/sundlaug-kopavogs/ Opening hours: Summer opening 1. May to 30. September Weekdays: 06:30 – 22:00 Weekends: 08:00 – 20:00 Winter opening, 1. October to 30. April Weekdays: 06:30 – 22:00 Weekends: 08:00-18:00 Kópavogur swimming pool has been one of the more popular swimming pools in Iceland in the last years. The swimming pool is one of the larger pools in Iceland. In 2008 a large part of the pool was renovated. There are three pools as well as a small pool by the water slider. There is one 50 meter pool, one 25 meter and a 10 meter indoor pool. There are seven hot tubs, one of them is a Jacuzzi and one is for children. There are three water slides that are very popular with the younger generation as well as one for the very youngest. There is also a good steam bath and a gym in the building. Price: - 850 ISK/ adult - 150 ISK/children 10-17 years old - Free for children 0-9 years old
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRZrGoa8ccvGrV_s5maV2cp9SPsYU8CHkb6EjE0He-k6_8LtxT2QHyFyQ7Az_JlUscb2zppRTXzz0eD8KWEP0oNyLrhGcRbHOohmQRd5RWiiR5tIIHAChXCkKsvpgHsJtMIBKWm-47Qj6y65SIyNo2KkU6sBai5HqB4r2AYyXqUpYqmPbHZsGMxEPGAuSejBHK7qjdNE18IhmXWB4TcX6G1ROHyjnxEzwTPTRs0E4NYzASX2Bon3tAKIJk?authuser=0&fife=s16383
