    <Placemark>
      <name>Varmárlaug</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/varmarlaug/ Opening hours: Summer opening hours (10. June to 25. August): Weekdays: 06:30 – 21:00 Saturdays: 09:00 – 17:00 Sundays: 09:00 – 16:00 Winter opening hours: Weekdays: 06:30 – 08:00 and 16:00 – 21:00 Saturdays: 09:00 – 17:00 Sundays: 09:00 – 16:00 The Varmá sports center features a 25-m outdoor swimming pool, 1-3-m deep. It also has a Jacuzzi, children’s splash tub and hot tub of 40-42°C, sauna and an ice-cold tub, designed to soften stiff muscles. The area also has a campsite and a Viking playground. Price: - 800 ISK/ adult - 150 ISK/children 11-17 years old - Free for children 0-10 years old
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTdpMrEX6LE-4mSj05cTINepX35I9DECNCMaQCdhB-6pbTAEPzCmALMqFONVbiigADqtakTo1ZC3IwoVT3qO27q-UM4NyIzMS2s40dOOB0B-m9nkJLZ_H_7HzjA5ZHiV-wjrQrw4IGAqPIvhgL4yD3tQuJWryZQM3_88dHMjzvHFB6-ZGcSZ2QV1FwfeCopjxoGrbWVin01wTlgxGPrEPxDG8k2BA8kDqwjLhE3vQF3LSvE87JOPPm-EpM?authuser=0&fife=s16383
