      <name>Vesturbæjarlaug</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/vesturbaejarlaug/ Opening hours: Weekdays: 06:30 – 22:00 Weekends: 09:00 – 22:00 There are four outdoor hot tubs, one has a massage. There are also two saunas, one for men and the other for women. There is also a nice coffeehouse and bakery nearby. Price: - 980 ISK/ adult - 150 ISK/children 6-17 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
