    <Placemark>
      <name>Lýsuhólslaug Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/lysulaugar-2/ Opening hours: All days: 11:00 – 20:30 There is no admission after 20:00 Winter opening hours: Mondays: 07:30 – 10:10 and 14:00 – 21:00 Tuesdays: 07:30 – 08:30 and 09:10 – 10:00 and 11:00 – 13:20 and 14:00 – 21:00 Wednesdays: 07:30 – 08:30 and 14:00 – 21:00 Thursdays: 07:30 – 10:00 and 13:00 – 13:20 and 14:00 – 21:00 Fridays: 07:30 – 12:00 and 14:00 – 21:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 17:00 There is no admission later than 30 minutes before closing. Lýsuhólslaug/Lýsulaugar is an extraordinary geothermal bath, filled with naturally hot mineral water. It is rich in green algae (chlorella) and various minerals and is thought to have a soothing and healing effect on the body. Price: - 1.000 ISK/ adult - 300 ISK/children 6-17 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRibSmjAPDofjAR8SJUNIYVfwXJsk3-yOtGkEf-WfPJyk0ZCWZXez3OxQvX7ZeJdQtxUBAS-UaB_L3iCGGO2xgKyqmW8PrQfQoJO6xnMQKPNBoNGxRcNAIwb2WtpsyNDleZWp7YmATiVsrvOHVXreuBFnYULhrt9H4pThZTvXtTS3gRfU1wSOSbwkm9ForxTYS5xDbqYEJrBpqXWd69lh_GKZacZMt96sjmmE5jLdstUiTXSAN9FCsXezY?authuser=0&fife=s16383
