      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/frettir/sundlaugin-olafsvik-lokud/ Opening hours: Summer opening, from 1. June: Weekdays: 07:30 – 21:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 17:00 Winter opening: Mondays: 07:30 – 10:10 and 14:00 – 21:00 Tuesdays: 07:30 – 08:30 and 09:10 – 10:00 and 11:00 – 13:20 and 14:00 – 21:00 Wednesdays: 07:30 – 08:30 and 14:00 – 21:00 Thursdays: 07:30 – 10:00 and 13:00 – 13:20 and 14:00 – 21:00 Fridays: 07:30 – 12:00 and 14:00 – 21:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 17:00 One 12.5 meter indoor pool and two outdoor hot tubs along with an outdoor children's pool with a small slide. Next to the swimming pool is a large and new sports hall, soccer field, playground and a school. Price: - 900 ISK/ adult - 300 ISK/children 10-16 years old - Free for children 0-9 years old
