      <name>Stykkishólmur Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/stykkisholmur-2/ Opening hours: Summer opening 1. June to 31. August: Mondays – Thursdays: 07:05- 22:00 Fridays: 07:05 – 19:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 18:00 Winter opening, 1. September to 31. May: Mondays – Fridays: 07:05 – 22:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 17:00 The swimming pool is a 25×12 meter outdoor swimming pool with a 57 meters long water slide. There is a children's pool, two hot tubs and 12 m indoor pool. The hot tubs have a health water in them that comes from a drilling hole by Hofsstaðir. The water is good to treat all sorts of skin problems such as eczema and psoriasis. Price: - 900 ISK/ adult - 300 ISK/children 6-17 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
