      <name>Varmahlíð Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/varmahlid-2/ Opening hours: Summer opening (from 1. June): Weekdays: 07:00 – 21:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 17:00 Winter opening, (from 26. August): Mondays – Thursdays: 09:00 – 21:00 Fridays: 09:00 – 14:00 Saturdays: 10:00 – 15:00 Sundays: 10:00 – 15:00 in September. Closed on other Sundays during winter. The swimming pool has two areas. The larger area is a 12,5 x 25 meter long pool and the smaller is a 12,5 x 8 meter children's pool. In the children's pool the water is warmer and there is also a small water slider that is very popular with the children. There is also a hot tub. Price: - 900 ISK/adult - 300 ISK/children 6-18 years old - Free for children 0-6 years old
