    <Placemark>
      <name>Akureyri Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/akureyri-swimming-pool/ Opening hours: Summer opening (5. June to 24. August): Weekdays: 06:45 – 21:00 Saturdays: 08:00 – 21:00 Sundays: 08:00 – 19:30 Winter opening (25. August to 4. June): Weekdays: 06:45 – 21:00 Weekends: 09:00 – 18:30 The Akureyri swimming pool is a water paradise for the whole family. There are two swimming pools, 25 meter long. Three new water slides and one of them is the longest waters slider in Iceland. Four hot tubs, sauna and an area for sunbathing. The pool area is very popular with the locals as well as tourists. Price: - 950 ISK/adult - 250 ISK/children 6-17 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
