    <Placemark>
      <name>Glerárlaug Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/glerarlaug-2/ Opening hours: Winter opening (21 August - 7 June): Weekdays: 6:45 - 8:00 and 17:30 - 21:00 Saturday: 09:00 - 14:30 Sunday: 09:00 - 12:00 Summer opening (6 June - 22 August): Weekdays: 6:45 - 21:00 Saturday: 09:00 - 14:30 Sunday: Closed Glerárlaug is a great indoor swimming pool suitable for children and teenagers swimming, as well as all the other amenities that indoors have to offer. There are also two hot tubs and a swimming pool in addition to an outdoor swimming pool. Price: - 950 ISK/adult - 250 ISK/children 6-17 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
