    <Placemark>
      <name>Dalvík Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/dalvik-2/ Opening hours: Mondays – Thursdays: 06:15 – 20:00 Fridays: 06:15 – 19:00 Weekends: 09:00 – 17:00 The Dalvík swimming pool was first opened in the fall 1994. It is well known for a beautiful architecture and a great view. The pool is very popular among tourists to rest and sunbathe during the summers and to experience the northern lights from the hot tubs during winter. The pool is 12,5 m x 25 m big, there are hot tubs, children's pool, water slider, sauna and also a good gym. Price: - 750 ISK/adult - 350 ISK/children 6-18 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
