    <Placemark>
      <name>Hrafnagil Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/5m65ZPiGJfjHLVUZA Opening hours: Summer opening Weekdays: 06:30 – 22:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 20:00 Winter opening. Weekdays: 06:30 – 21:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 17:00 The swimming pool in Eyjafjarðarsveit has good access for the disabled. It is possible to get a private changing room, shower chair and elevators for the hot tub and the swimming pool. It is possible to open a door to the dressing room for extra space. The swimming pool was first opened in January 2007. The swimming pool is 10×25 meters and it has hot tubs, children's pool, a water slider and a steam bath. The temperature in the pool itself is about 30°C The pool is located next to the school Hrafnagilsskóli and is around 10 km south. Next to the swimming pool is the camp site. Price: - 700 ISK/adult - 350 ISK/teens 18-20 years old - 200 ISK/children 6-18 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRFI7ur25_koOqURwQm-zF2N7mu6jjrxRHdC6WPeH9bzKR1w-CZOmHp6Iun0o3R80Ccllog2e7chvplVE1rROS1i7zG-i2eQs_wIg00A94IvVSIkqQTHAAGYqu3eDTdIR4k8EmC2DyNkDMFHcc7rNfMI4CeaBmPF4-3q6mHbjGdkvc8o9zGpxojBiEQYi_XVAjAfkZzilvUHr6HAXWpPY2crebU3K1awEzjGegj1KytRKYlrClEhoFjB88?authuser=0&fife=s16383
