    <Placemark>
      <name>Grenivík Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/grenivik-swimming-pool/ Opening hours: Summer opening (from 4th June): Weekdays: 10:00 – 19:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 18:00 The pool closes earlier because of a sports match on the following days: 13. June– pool closes at 17:30 30. June– pool closes at 14:00 14. July– pool closes at 14:00 21. July – pool closes at 14:00 28. July– pool closes at 14:00 9. August– pool closes at 16:00 18. August– pool closes at 14:00 2. September – pool closes at 14:00 15. September – pool closes at 12:00 Winter opening from 24. August: Mondays – Thursdays: 15:00 – 18:00 Fridays: Closed Saturdays: 10:00 – 13:00 Sundays: Closed The pool has recently been renovated. It is 16,67 m long and there is a hot tub and a sauna. It has a great view over Grenivík and to the fjord Eyjafjörður. The swimming pool is next to the camp site that was also renovated in 2011. Price: - 700 ISK/adult - 300 ISK/children
