    <Placemark>
      <name>Grímsey Swimming Pool </name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/sundlaug-grimseyjar-2/ Opening hours: Mondays, Tuesdays and Wednesdays: 20.00 - 21.30 Saturdays: 14.00 - 16.00 The pool in Grímsey is open 4 days a week. This is an indoor pool, which is not as common in Iceland as outdoor pools. The reason is that there is no geothermal water in Grímsey, so the water for the pool is freshwater that has been heated. The pool is 12.6 x 6 meters, a hot pot, showers and toilets. Price: - 550 ISK/adult - 200 ISK/children 6-17 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQs6rjnc9-eDHcuNPRcWFRsxY54jMDDTGclMTaQCquhpUHbvR47uPcOvhglA8iPfwzg4LN4Bj8CSDOHQs4mzjPEPdjr190cOUzQOC5cfZZv6CGAfuU4OjvACSIge47fHCSL2tDSw-3G1RaZrzFCOiugOcqIdQT11vLQxvD4kLkfwRY2x3TibuOnvXMkYyNvqoH29NZ7QixKbY1Qv84p_Y0xnL4GAR6F2sFGnoYNdv8WXvW7I9rpUDqATn8?authuser=0&fife=s16383
