    <Placemark>
      <name>Heiðarbær Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/heidarbaer/ Opening hours: Open in June, July and August from 11:00 – 22:00 every day of the week. Open 1 – 13th of September: 16:00 – 21:00 Heiðarbær is in a great location for those who wish to explore the eastern side of North Iceland. From Heiðarbær is a short distance to many of the most popular attractions such as lake Mývatn, the waterfall Goðafoss, Ásbyrgi and the canyon Jökulsárgljúfur. Heiðarbær also has a camp site, guesthouse and a restaurant. The pool has two hot tubs and an area for sunbathing. Price: - 700 ISK/adult - 300 ISK/children 6-17 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
