    <Placemark>
      <name>Húsavík Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/sundlaug-husavikur-2/ Opening hours Summer opening (10. June to 23. August): Weekdays: 06:45 – 21:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 18:00 Winter opening (24. August to 9. June): Mondays – Thursdays: 06:45 – 09:30 og 14:30 – 21:00 Fridays: 06:45 – 09:30 and 14:30 – 19:00 Weekends: 10:00-18:00 The swimming pool is 16,67 meters long and 6,95 meters wide. The depth is 0,9 m – 2,5 m. The pool was renovated around the year 2000. New dressing rooms were added and the old building renovated a lot. Temperature: Swimming pool 29,5°C Childrens pool 37°C Jacuzzi 38°C Hot tub 41°C The hot tubs are all big and recently tiled. There are three hot tubs and two waterslides that are open during the summer time. The swimming pool is in a good location only about 100 m from the camp site, the sports arena is right opposite and there is a short distance to museums, restaurants, the harbour and other services. Price: - 700 ISK/adult - 300 ISK/children 6-17 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
