      <name>Hraunborgir Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/qRXKkBfC5BBTmzcF9 Opening hours: Summer opening only (1. May to 1st of October): Mondays to Thursdays: 10:00 – 20:00 Fridays and Saturdays: 10:00 – 22:00 Sundays: 10:00 – 20:00 The swimming pool in Hraunborgir is a swimming pool, two hot tubs, children's pool and a sauna. Next to the swimming pool is a service center that offers all kinds of activities such as mini golf, basketball, playground, pool table, darts and TV. In the area is a camp site and summer houses. There is also an excellent 9 hole golf course in a beautiful surroundings. Ideal to relax in the hot tubs after playing 9 holes. Price: - 800 ISK/adult - 400 ISK/children 6-12 years old - Free for children 0-5 years old
