      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/kirkjubaejarklaustur-2/ Summer opening (1. June to 30. September): Weekdays: 10:00 – 20:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 20:00 Winter opening (1. October to 31. May): Mondays – Saturdays: 11:00- 20:00 Sundays: 15:00 – 19:00 A new pool was opened in the spring 2008. Next to the swimming pool is a children's pool and a hot tub. The sports hall was opened in 2004 and has changed all facilities for sports in the village. The gym and sports hall have the same opening hours as the swimming pool. Price: - 900 ISK/adult - 300 ISK/children
