      <name>Laugaland Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/sundlaugin-laugalandi-2/ Opening hours: Summer opening (1. June to 20. August): Weekdays: 14:00- 21:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 19:00 Winter opening (21. August to 31. May): Tuesdays and Thursdays: 18:00 – 21:00 The swimming pool in Laugalandi, south Iceland is about 6 km from highway no. 1. From highway no. 1 you turn onto road no 26. The distance from Selfoss is about 35 km and from Reykjavík about 90 km. The swimming pool has two hot tubs and a water slide. Price: - 900 ISK/adult - 300 ISK/children 8-15 years old - Free for children 0-7 years old
