      <name>Neslaug Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/neslaug-2/ Opening hours: Summer Opening (2nd of June – 31st of August): Mondays: Closed. Tuesdays: 14-22 Wednesdays: 14-22 Thursdays: 14-22 Fridays: 14-18 Saturdays: 10-18 Sundays: 10-18 Winter Opening (1. October – 1. May): Wednesdays: 17:00 – 22:00 Saturdays: 13:00 – 18:00 Neslaug swimming pool was first opened in 1998 and is located in Árnes, south Iceland, by highway no 32. The pool is 12,5 m long and wide. There is a hot tub and some swimming related products for sale. Next to Neslaug swimming pool is the sport field, football field, playground and tourist information center. Price: - 900 ISK/adult - 500 ISK/children 11-17 years old - Free for children 0-10 years old
