    <Placemark>
      <name>Reykholtslaug</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/reykholtslaug-2/ Opening hours: Summer opening (25th of May - 12th of August): Monday-Thursday: 10:00 - 21:00 Friday: 10:00 - 18:00 Weekends: 10:00 - 18:00 Winter Opening (13th of August - 26th of May) Monday and Wednesday: 14:00 - 18:00. Tuesday and Thursday: 14:00 - 22:00 Saturdays 10: 00 - 18:00 Friday and Sunday: closed. The swimming pool in Reykholt is located in the sport center. The pool features a water slide and two hot tubs. In the sport center there is also an indoor sports arena and a fitness center. Price: - 1.000 ISK/adult - 550 ISK/children 10-17 years old - Free for children 0-10 years old
