    <Placemark>
      <name>Selfoss Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/frettir/sundholl-selfoss-lokud-timabundid/ Opening hours: Weekdays: 06:30 – 21:30 Weekends: 09:00 – 19:00 The swimming pool in Selfoss is located near the center of town within walking distance from shops and services. Next to the swimming pool are plenty of free parking spaces. The swimming pool has a 18 meter long indoor children's pool, 25 meter long outdoor pool, children's pool with three water slides, water steam bath, sauna and hot tubs. There are four dressing rooms, two outside and two inside. A new building was built next to the swimming pool in 2015 that made a lot of difference regarding the facilities. World Class gym is located on the top floor with the same reception as the swimming pool. The swimming pool is one of the biggest pools in South Iceland. Price: - 980 ISK/adult - 150 ISK/children 10-18 years old - Free for children 0-9 years old
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSXiRQFtNppQBM16S-kKsb0gYCv-xpf77RJwbRJHW4rJ9YF5rj0UxSUWe70-9rtgKJFa7VLW7dkemAqqPREkuouS-PSNyPK5ElAXekS4BvP4DSLbJC5v8B1rltPeR9VNZ_JetYzerDBOrFLbzxXpla5Tx-df-JrGfu-sZIeqSmgAozqdgtl6Osn3Fn5vRbYw8BBua_-Zoo1OOK5WWR0bUj6iJDKEYWuAie7GTdb1kiQr2HrYprxtBTvBeE?authuser=0&fife=s16383
