    <Placemark>
      <name>Stokkseyri Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/stokkseyri-2/ Opening hours: Summer opening (1. June to the middle of August): Weekdays: 13:00 – 21:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 17:00 Winter opening (from the middle of August to 31. May): Weekdays: 16:30 – 20:30 Weekends: 10:00 – 15:00 Stokkseyri swimming pool is a friendly country pool in the heart of Stokkseyri. The pool is 18 meter long outdoor pool with a water slide, children's pool and two hot tubs. There are spacious women's and men's dressing rooms. There is a short distance from the swimming pool to restaurants, museum, art gallery and the shore as the village is next to the south shore. Price: - 980 ISK/adult - 150 ISK/children 10-18 years old - Free for children 0-9 years old
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQfHi96bXbgSvhor_p5PxVafgKNZOhW9aLq1IpdEegVhL6E3pxUev-4qcFE_k7htkPVCBKg0DyJoa59s7MyX4dqSkTXyJEPU6qmbnn4D6yvzlHTNQBaiwXPeDFCxcWjobqj72snLmjVL9UYE-GPzmP8Tg35c_Oi_ydoHSZHVPnY2IeDRl3Igiy1WOPR0n82IGtNrV8GW5fIwONuF6EvKgJLwynz-gaH2a5OAsVzfqSCbhoJXRD6WvLvQ5Q?authuser=0&fife=s16383
