      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/vik/ Summer opening (from 1. June until end of August) Weekdays: 10:00 – 19:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 19:00 Winter opening: Mondays: 14:00 – 19:00 Tuesdays – Fridays: 13:30 – 19:00 Saturdays – Sundays: 10:00 – 16:00 The swimming pool in Vík has two outdoor pools. The main pool is 16,7 meters and the temperature is 28 – 29°C. The children's pool is about 37 – 39°C. There is one hot tub that is 40 – 42°C. Price: - 600 ISK/adult - 300 ISK/children
