    <Placemark>
      <name>Þorlákshöfn Swimming Pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://sundlaugar.is/en/sundlaugasafn/thorlakshofn-2/ Opening hours: Summer opening (1. June to 31. August): Weekdays: 07:00 – 21:00 Weekends: 10:00 – 18:00 Winter opening (1. September to 31. May): Weekdays: 07:00 – 21:00 Weekends 10:00 – 17:00 Hot tubs are being renovated and during these renovations there are not hot tubs available. Renovations may last most of June 2018. Other pools are working and the temperature will be a little higher during the renovations. The swimming pool in Þorlákshöfn is a 25 meter long pool, with two hot tubs, children´s pool, two water slides and an indoor children´s pool with toys. The indoor pool is only 45 cm deep and very popular with the kids. By the pool is a water steam bath, two spacious dressing rooms and two outdoor dressing rooms. On the second floor is a gym with an equipment room and a gymnastic room. There is also dressing rooms and two saunas. On the balcony there are three tubs, two hot and one cold. Price: - 900 ISK/adult - Free for children
