      <name>Garðskagi</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.gardskagi.com/campsite Please park in the actual camping spaces, not in the parking lot. There's a coffee house in the lighthouse. Phone: 893-8909 Price for adults: 1.500 ISK Price for children (0-12 years): free Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (1000 ISK) - Pool/hot tub - Hiking trails - Playground - Store access
