    <Placemark>
      <name>Reykjavik/Laugardalur Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.reykjavikcampsite.is This is the only campsite in Reykjavik that alllows tents. It is very close to the city center and therefore a popular campsite for travelers spending nights in the city. It is located to a nice swimming pool and has all the amenities you would need over the summertime. The only downside is that it can get a bit more crowded and is more expensive than other campsites. Phone: 553-8110 Price: ISK 3200/adult (2880 ISK when booked online with discount code: Online) Free for 13 year olds and younger Cyclist get -20% off. Facilities: - WC - Shower - Water - Electricity (ISK 1550) - Pool/hot tub (Laugardalslaug swimming pool is next door) - Cooking facilities - Luggage storage - Washer/dryer - Wi-Fi - Breakfast available 8:00 – 10:00 (ISK 1850/person – at Dalur Hostel by the campsite)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRr46Z8Tj2shp7cu842S-xIuGQ4wqEFdyVSgOGr9X1Iwu2lxB3FCmAv8OZlXAe6MtEwCcyW5RBV7ujH260nbSiY_CB-i-vx1DaHC39it-wt75icnkbrkD8zVnZb42uw-FZqMM0PjShq6whAmc1jaxa-9kr3Dl-9aQGHBSLepKdh_GY0sE9QnzDXLmLnWjfMFHZp1cthmcY4KsGJN-ny4Y33AwyZVPNklNpJeFsnP8GclIav967tCMvwZYQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://www.reykjavikcampsite.is

Commentaire: Style: icon:1603,color:000000 | gx_media_links: https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRr46Z8Tj2shp7cu842S-xIuGQ4wqEFdyVSgOGr9X1Iwu2lxB3FCmAv8OZlXAe6MtEwCcyW5RBV7ujH260nbSiY_CB-i-vx1DaHC39it-wt75icnkbrkD8zVnZb42uw-FZqMM0PjShq6whAmc1jaxa-9kr3Dl-9aQGHBSLepKdh_GY0sE9QnzDXLmLnWjfMFHZp1cthmcY4KsGJN-ny4Y33AwyZVPNklNpJeFsnP8GclIav967tCMvwZYQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383

