    <Placemark>
      <name>Gata free camping</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://happycampers.is/best-free-and-cheap-campsites-in-iceland/ The camp site is on three platforms that are divided with lava and grass. A beautiful horse shoe formation has been made out of lava. A walking path is from the camp site to the hot dog stand. The camp site has 7 benches. The service house has cold and hot running wather, toilets, showers and sinks to do the dishes in. A large coal barbeque is in the area. There is also a service house that guests can sit in. There are many walking paths close by and the shore and the church is a short distance away. Facilities: - WC - Showers - Hot and cold water - Cooking facilities - Restaurant - BBQ area Price: - Donation
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTiIKO7Q3i6NKCFmIo5xmxF7HOUDoCpk5oDNGyfSKYD9q0Kta_Zx0OcAFXvMmLaiu2EDjctV0xYqTsg-wjo2AfnxLDcLvmiIqqzDRDMDXOXz3xLs6yALOV40us3unl8mTqoyGWg_PZYUs4r0eU3B9js7hI_oUpqsNo8_DEqRuL_7sgn6DC9tEFg_EmzZySyKFLDDTazs_Sa8TI8h727ld2OwhHfNJKZOBUgUJb3D2NRZeUi9d8DY176bLg?authuser=0&fife=s16383
