    <Placemark>
      <name>Thingvellir National Park</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.thingvellir.is/en/service/camping/ A beautiful campsite in one of Iceland's most beautiful national parks. The service building is open all year where you can get some snacks or use the bathrooms. Open: All year around The Leirar campground is divided into four camping grounds: Fagrabrekka, Syðri- Leirar, Hvannabrekka and Nyrðri-Leirar. In winter the campsite grass is sensitive, so campers are asked to stay on the parking lot next to the service center Phone: 482-2660 Price: ISK 1,300 p/adult, 650 p/senior (67+), free age 0-17. Facilities: - WC - Store access - Electricity (900 ISK) - Washer/dryer (800 ISK) There is no reservation needed for camping in any campsite at Thingvellir national park. Camping and angling permits should be obtained at the Information Centre on arrival.
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGR2Qiy7IiUi3kT7E9OScHzW0jZI4FnsZ0qBU_yK2-VK6UrzIHzSjoPEQyUkWB2TtRZqtxzerygQvRjzuz1Nu6mcTitiXuBfHFJbR5RjYQKLKBey1RLxgOa7LEO-md06ivPAY38HAVnAR1szMQOncjrlHudBf_ie9CbFbaPQiywEEFyOHBsvLeb54MfNdU7xgBzPlVR1R_rb1zkLg5rb8XQHALYoSl0YclfIDgFwPOSKRRNmEsDAYe0KP8M?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://www.thingvellir.is/en/service/camping/

