    <Placemark>
      <name>Campsite Selfoss</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/gesthus/ Selfoss campsite has everything you'll need while on the road. The campsite has lots of nice amenities and is located close to grocery stores, swimming pool, restaurants, etc. Phone: 482-3585 Email: gesthus@gesthus.is Price: ISK 2500/unit+1 person, +1500 kr for extra person (Free for 15 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Shower - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Water - Washer/dryer (Kr. 800) - Pool/hot tub (Kr. 800) - Cooking facilities - Playground - Store access - Wi-Fi - Waste disposal - Breakfast buffet (Kr. 1700)
