    <Placemark>
      <name>Skjòl Campgrounds</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/skjol/ A campsite conveniently located between the popular attractions Geysir and Gullfoss. Better yet, they are also open during winter. The campsite is large and not crowded, and they have most of the services you would ever need at a campsite (even free wifi!) "Highly recommend for campsite, food, bar, friendly owners. Loved it !" - Jay Fisher Phone: +354 8994541 Prices: Adults 1.500 ISK Children 5-15 years 750 ISK (Younger children free of charge) Senior over 70 years 800 ISK Facilities: - Water - WC - Shower (Kr. 400) - Washer - Dryer - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Restaurant - Free WiFi - Hiking paths - Horse rental
