      <name>Skógar Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/skogafoss/ Campsite by the famous Skógafoss waterfall. The location is terrific, although we have heard that facilities and maintenance have been lacking. Phone: 863-8064 Price: ISK 1,500/adult Facilities: - WC - Shower - Water - Hiking trails
