    <Placemark>
      <name>Djúpivogur</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/djupivogur/ This campsite is in front of Hotel Framtid. Please go to the reception to check in to the campsite. It is located in the small and charming town of Djúpivogur, which should be a destination for anybody driving through the East. The surroundings are beautiful but the campsite itself is rather small. Facilities might be locked during the off season if no one is there, but if you check in at Hotel Framtið they will keep it open for you. Phone: 478-8887 Price: ISK 1,750/adult + Kr. 330/unit/night Facilities: - WC - Shower (ISK 300) - Electricity (ISK 1050) - Water - Hiking trails - Playground - Store access - Wi-Fi (ISK 500/day)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQRowDkPviSK5Vm-YwvPCCVbOIJipjR1qsVZwwKhkgnSGDs_IhNyAvEjd64Fb3HoDeHw4sLD-DY1Ov4J8ZYIaeHgHt3L_F-491-ZwtrqWXkrPnvqvEyhQhLbYg7yHk9txP0_X_gUSchwPPU3l_SGvnIq_EZshdWySbrf2woZz83sCkJRFy7c97DK-gNSGHAA8nHzFfMkSFetigP6wNBVdJBx3K1kgLNLI76857pvboAbHOz999WqV-Os-0?authuser=0&fife=s16383
