    <Placemark>
      <name>Egilsstaðir</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/egilsstadir/ Egilsstaðir is considered the "capital of the East" and this charming town offers everything you need, from mini golf to spas. The campsite is located towards the town center and is c lose to gas stations and grocery stores. Open: All year (must book online https://campegilsstadir.is/) Phone: 470-0750 Price: ISK 2000 (Kr. 1000 senior citizens) Facilities: - WC - Shower - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Water - Pool/hot tub - Washer/dryer (Kr. 800) - Cooking facilities - Hiking trails - Playground - Store access - Waste disposal - Wi-Fi (Kr. 400/24 hours) - Dogs allowed - Bike rental - Horse rental
