    <Placemark>
      <name>Möðrudalur Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/fjalladyrd-modrudal/ Welcome to Möðrudalur Campground, where you can enjoy the beauty of mountain scenery away from the beaten track, staying at the highest farm in Iceland. Nevertheless, you will still have all the major conveniences, whether you camp in a tent, an RV, caravan, trailer or anything else. Open: All year Phone: +354 471 1858 / +354 894 0758 Price: Kr. 1350 /adult (Free for 15 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Electricity (Kr. 1350) - WiFi - Showers (Kr. 500) - Water - Waste disposal - Hiking trails - Cooking facilities - Washer/dryer -Fjallakaffi restaurant – only steps awaygas -Mini football field -Frisbee golf -NEW!!! FAT BIKE RENTAL -The petrol station (which also sells diesel) is an old-style turf building – come and experience our unique surroundings while filling up your car!!!
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQtzoX1ikowHBxllJ-GCpoPg6z_vuyLttUgb2_-QGag3yZpF7j00XyCWwkA1E4mq6a9gg16kYL5b14cLVKGaDFyN7I5zm-nqpuyuLsaSe7_ctgUXe8e9jqjOiD704NQw4oRVjfv0ntrgi1bYaqpg1xouQRVbI-1ZNRWdfyRMuiCGoN4dPmcqEVs7NDSrGCP8quUCE9-wj7KwM8GOxI9PJt2H9oSRk0DrDC5BD5-EVLR6uZIvxpKxkxOReo?authuser=0&fife=s16383
