    <Placemark>
      <name>Vogar / Myvatn</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.vogartravelservice.com A lovely little campsite by the popular Lake Myvatn. Indoor toilets and hot showers are included in the price and easy access to outdoor kitchen sinks. If you camp there 3 nights, the 4th night is free. During winter times, payment for the campground must be made online upon arrival. Phone: 478-8887 Price: ISK 2,000/person, Kr. 500/van Facilities: - WC - Shower - Electricity (kr. 500) - Water - Pool/hot tub - Cooking facilities - Hiking trails - Wi-Fi - Waste disposal - Dogs welcome (on a leash)
