    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Reykjahlíð (Hlíð) Campsite/Cottages</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/hlid/ The camp site has first class facilities. Sinks with hot and cold water are located on several places around the camp site, 2 toilet houses and 1 shower house. Electricity is available around the site but has an extra fee. There are not many trees in the area but the area is cosy. The area is about 1 km from lake Mývatn so there are not alot of flies at the camp site. A small store is at the area where it is possible to buy candy, soda, dairy products and post cards. A large kitchen tent is also at the camp site. Phone: +354 464 4103 Price: Kr. 2200/adult (Free for 16 and younger) Facilities: - Cooking facilities - Electricity (Kr. 750) - Playground - Shower (included) - WC - Water - Waste disposal - Dogs allowed - Pool/hot tub - Hiking paths
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSjyhtrcF5LUOyc3VYqyWcn7yf5Fno5PsuL8VP92zS6rI1wUpKRxdxIEPKLQhcqZ5969tDfYT0O4eFl315EKPV0-9yCeYYB7wo5NPoszUO81nz7HLlP2xdbDGObaWDyNnJq393XOvTIk7xykeiPrTfrZuiEIHePZzbbqO8NH4ziguEWXm7j1jpPdd1qMf8-28smS50IF9TZFHqOrqRENFJkLx7OjHMEIvUY68viSrdjQcmu47ii57BduyA?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/hlid/

