    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Lifsmotun camping</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/lifsmotun/ This campsite is on a farm Hjalli, only 2 km from the town of Laugar. Myvatn is only 35 km away and Husavik 40km. This is one of the few campsites that allows reservations in advance and will give you a designated area with some privacy. You will find many amenities at Laugar, such as a swimming pool, supermarket, and a restaurant Book online: https://parka.is/lifsmotun-camping/ Phone: 864-8790 Adults (18 years and older): - in areas A - F and L - M: 1.500 ISK - in areas G - K and M: 1.800 ISK Teenagers (13 - 17 years old): 500 ISK Children (0 - 12 years old): Free Facilities: - WC - Shower - Electricity - Water - Pool/hot tub (2km) - Hiking paths - Playground - Waste disposal - Dogs welcome
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQeQ_NiHl6GsxbqtPYOi27XZqShWGwtH5xkxuZCGMyGqFi8duPXm0dlfm-Q6zVIGXKXSHxYhnAIJbKob0lkvyMZ5h0JEOq5-xMXbvTJwwrH5Ry7xpWp9kcfLL0Y860wmSg81RuXlAxFWzHA8uYT6W5dVrS4MW0CwGmg6meKW-8sHHpTuIDwgo6zhSlRyFiCcOlGr9k_B_GY0Xiwnq3YbH3J20hS8cv69DL_ZhsXvB3CrumxMzKaBMKL55k?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/lifsmotun/
