    <Placemark>
      <name>Akureyri (Hamrar)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/hamrar/ Great campsite with all the facilities that one might need. Hamrar is a peaceful campground by the forest kjarnaskógur, at the southern end of Akureyri. The camping is well equipped with excellent facilities, playgrouds, and great hiking trails. The camping is divided into 16 grass areas, surrounded by trees, that extend to 3-4000 m2. Camp wardens can provide all the information and help you need regarding the campground. They are available from 7am to 12pm daily on peak season. If they are not at the gate warden hut, they can be reached at (+354) 8630725. Phone: 461-2264 Price: ISK 1,900/adult(free under 18) Facilities: - WC - Shower - Electricity (Kr. 1200) - Washer/dryer (Kr. 500) - Water - Cooking facilities - Hiking trails - Playground
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTyH_GQrK8ye8s69mr9zPUpxHlFp1jguep_siJnxYmbbvb_mfMIv0StpK7PN-e9FzKT2Erdjf6VqaPnI1gg-QIQ0aIXNbX_m7AVA3VERy5bjRifivhDCmWgCBJ0HSw9hgUWGOjT-HQr4qxOhwXbCkLVf1jVVBSUmeJlwo5VgkmnBbyf9q8D1u0-c5_0uPpvxyweFScqxwdYvFmokB8POloBl8BfX2Fz2wD2wwk0zvby9q0loOsfvzQB-Us?authuser=0&fife=s16383
