      <name>Dalvík (Guesthouse Skeið)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/dalvik/ The guesthouse keeps their campsite open for customers all year around as long as the weather permits. Although they do recommend having a 4x4 do get there in the high winter time. Phone: 466-1636 Price: N/A Camping only on request Facilities: - WC - Shower - Water - Pool/hot tub - Sauna - Washer/dryer - Cooking facilities - Wi-Fi
