    <Placemark>
      <name>Steinsstaðalaug Camping</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/Zg59c5j1ApKBEPji7 Located by the guesthouse, this campsite is large and provides decent shelter. It is located about 11 km from Varmahlíð and is open all year round. Phone: 899-8762 Price: N/A Facilities: - WC - Shower - Electricity - Water - Pool/hot tub - Cooking facilities - Hiking trails - Playground - Wi-Fi - Waste disposal
