    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Illugastaðir</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/cDbDc64vECQTsViB9 CLOSED FROM MAY 1ST to JUNE 20TH EVERY YEAR (To protect eider ducks). Even though they are open during winter, there is no employee there, only an honesty box where you pay Kr. 1000. During winter, there is one WC and running water, although the water outside is usually not available in the winter time. At Illugastaðir on Vatnsnes peninsula you find one of the best seal watching place in Iceland. There are good facilities and service for travellers. Good walking path is next to the ocean and a trail to the sealwatching place. There you also find nice sealwatching hut to stay in when the weather is bad. The seals stays at Illugastaðir most days of the year, laying in rocks or swimming in the ocean close to the shore. Good camping site is at Illugastaðir and perfect place for walking in the nature. All kind of bird do nest at Illugastaðir, and large numbers of Arctic tern and eider ducks. Phone: 8698099 Price: 1200-1500 ISK Facilities: - WC - Electricity - Water
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRFBpLgGy5FDb3ea39v2-J5p_Zp6Hmv9SRGV_35AZ1rn1yN1YXUdI9iNYLNKVrRzkkjX9JYjZx5J3504n-fA0l8aXfwBX5oR9MfDpkDpPLjtmKkpldxIbevUQ3Dkc9uYjpSssDXrnBFVumohJoqTRZwxTYaw3v48YUfhrCZlteE2-cOyQwksW-sH2Kaiq7JiWJzePggHpirDgx5TkgMC1HsIIWZNwklmjgOdgoFEAnB2Em62zWgXAdrbno?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://goo.gl/maps/cDbDc64vECQTsViB9

Commentaire: Style: icon:1765,color:E65100 | gx_media_links: https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRFBpLgGy5FDb3ea39v2-J5p_Zp6Hmv9SRGV_35AZ1rn1yN1YXUdI9iNYLNKVrRzkkjX9JYjZx5J3504n-fA0l8aXfwBX5oR9MfDpkDpPLjtmKkpldxIbevUQ3Dkc9uYjpSssDXrnBFVumohJoqTRZwxTYaw3v48YUfhrCZlteE2-cOyQwksW-sH2Kaiq7JiWJzePggHpirDgx5TkgMC1HsIIWZNwklmjgOdgoFEAnB2Em62zWgXAdrbno?authuser=0&fife=s16383

