    <Placemark>
      <name>Búðardalur</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/budardalur/ The Budardalur camping site is located within a beautiful grove. When arriving from the south (route 60) you will see the camping site on your left. The Budardalur camping site is a great site for tents since you have the trees sheltering the tent on windy days. The site has many features such as a convenience store, coffee shop, soccer field, playground and a beach volley ball field. Phone: 434-1644 Price: ISK 1,500 Facilities: - Electricity (1000 ISK) - Washing Machine (500 ISK) - Dryer (500 ISK) - Shower (Free) - Use of stove (500 ISK) - WC
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTHaV_j9Oh0hJ7b-6Gh1NAIBFUSb375HKhsw9ZBLCJLWMh89p2MgI6L0_EdBwzgnrz-Nujx4P_MH8J8uTVb5y98NK42C7yu3eSXxh3GA2s1vTsc9SJ6XwJ4hKTKcC-3N1Ka3LLU9hZOSSCB_eMUzDXGci2D1kNV8fskte7t8ZgRkjhANl5kUBQzKPCqrSGAXG3bFvvXh433tqvyoSPECKbdxF1ggOpKSE-fO7LeEWcqWv_QbaZaXPAiuuY?authuser=0&fife=s16383
