    <Placemark>
      <name>Stykkishólmur Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/stykkisholmur/ The camp site is located in a good location in the village. Close to all services and a walking distance to the swimming pool. A bathing area with sinks and showers is located within the golf club house. There you will also find a coin washer and dryer. At the camping site you’ll find a bath house with toilets, outdoor sinks and shower (although closed in winter). The camp site has an age restricted. All guests under the age of 18 need to be accompanied by and adult. Phone: +354 438 1075 Price: Kr. 1600/adult (Free for 15 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1100) - WiFi - Playground - Pool/hot tub - Washing machine - Waste disposal - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSfnu0u6gJf837b4qXNM40Ej9BcH27p1bik_5VinraKvcXJucg_CAitDN-jxfxWeCqd4XRSVPPp-KUD7-uVNLu-lKOfjzYILodRr-Qv3elG_Lk04MmkLEA1PYDzx-rnPVjLsqwd1-HMijvb0PA_j4hGUKaZWaruTzj8Iqsf2k380fkiFDFvJtFwdm8F-r1m39Sdtmqt932kYQrZm_wvlEPo7icATfpHjKXNXB54jEdj0DxxSMY1ZDIo6ts?authuser=0&fife=s16383
