    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Snorrastaðir (Farm Holidays)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/snorrastadir/ Snorrastaðir is a small farm and guesthouse and allows travelers to camp next to the guesthouse all year around. Keep in mind it's not a traditional full service campsite but a good option in the wintertime when campsites are of short supply in the area. This campsite is located only 2.5 km from the volcano Eldborg, a 60 m. tall crater in the midst of a lava field. Phone: 435-6628 Price: ISK 3,000/unit Facilities: - WC - Showers (included) - Electricity (ISK 500) - Water - Hiking trails - Playground - Wi-Fi (included)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRiOu7A0TPN2wDRpL9XwcRf4Snsd1N-XdhTOsmwnJXeBbPl7qCa5V7sz3SiGstVX4hBL9HqTK8I8YwlwlASmE-PdtIaJ533xi6vgqbqGoGluIZVEoleyQchhh8q6CwcVc5kN-baT6zoTzy8NnF3B_sdNhUS2GWbMCXZQLByiJHjDrHcyYOxmqh0u-V9LDr618npSe_tkOFByolAlBVu4D9xuQyfUnQ9cVMVMnN67JEYsnNGIA9B-WZXwPw?authuser=0&fife=s16383
