      <styleUrl>#style_Campsites___Mountain_Huts</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-22.305014,64.7731,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Bjarteyjarsandur</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/bjarteyjarsandur/ Bjarteyjarsandur is a farm located in the beautiful Hvalfjordur fjord. It is a smaller, family friendly, campsite, located near many popular attractions such as Glymur waterfall. The campsite is located on a flat piece of land below the old farmhouse. There is one shower and bathrooms in the service house, and since the campsite caters to families, they expect that people keep it quiet after 23:00. Phone: 433-8831 Price: ISK 1,800/adult (800/child) Facilities: - WC - Showers - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Water - Cooking facilities (closes at 21:00) - Hiking trails - Restaurant - Wi-Fi
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTchrSbHhvLwyWVMQGpsO9XHMjNAY-f9x-8PcxRA3XSz0HlMa6D56IeKPyeWMvEDoFm0wDWsHn-d_gaHY3iyUiUiP9cOzxCeI3bUnv1bQ2xF_DFDf6e0bHZIfrA4I2wbEzU7SDcE_OgTljqQBvehoTsoOzzzVa7EjhFu7ngDaJUqO6EM0Ll6WW1zJDhG7cqK_vdVM-oL0I6NRObcOeS-1vLHIcDbHJdDGl9vJLZDK0DKtLLfXSQmhJbZQ0?authuser=0&fife=s16383
