    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Hólmavík Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/holmavik/ Hólmavík has a good campingsite. It is placed next to the swimming pool, sportcenter and the community center. The local grocery store is within 2 minute walking distance as well as a local crafts market. Hólmavík has a restaurant and a museum within fifteen minute walking distance from the campsite. There are marked walking routes in the area that offer a view of Hólmavík and its beautiful surroundings. The campingsite has a WC facilities and a washing machine, dryer and electricity for campers and mobil home. You can also enjoy comfortable daytrips by car to other interesting places around Hólmavík. It is not necessary to book in advance for tents, campers and mobil home at the campingsite, but it is suggested if travelling with a big group of people. Phone: +354 451 3560 Price: Kr. 1650/adult (free for 13 and younger) Disabled and old-age pensioners ISK 965 Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1440) - Washer/dryer (Kr. 810/810) - Pool/hot tub - Waste disposal - Hiking paths - Golf - Horse rental - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGScgzQz4e4YuKH3QdIuDbB7WUU6TdyFa49lc4lh4BplnPsEUE-Oa0fc_3pKHsrVAhEs7N-BT8olNrB4_s4W8n-5R7fKgFztaPFBMRERCz6VAyTWuvLuMGoTtg4APuPu7t_rFX-MnRRGYxlaZd6iEHEmwliJMa2rUVGosHhsx4AYKqRGp9cfsIpAvmDZ41mHzXEJnBPlpo4UAVHbxeGOLNPww2kkpujO6Ielwyzhs8bf6zz2nSHIfF_xf1Y?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/holmavik/

