    <Placemark>
      <name>Heydalur Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/heydalur/ The campsite is located along the river in the middle of the valley. It is equiped with free showers, toilets and a playground for children. Our guests are all welcome to use our natural thermal spring situated in front of the camping area. A swimming-pool and two other thermal springs are also available to relax or have fun with one’s family. The camping is not equiped with a kitchen area, but the restaurant is open from 11am to 3pm and to 6pm to 10 pm. Open: Usually open in winter if weather permits, please call ahead to check Phone: +354 456 4824 Price: Kr. 1500 (Free for 12 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Cooking facilities - Playground - Shower - Hiking paths - Pool/hot tub - Horse rental
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQwY6g2KqJBRnJcKL7XRxfpE1RoAlPzXP3XuxUyAjC3fiS9DVLZR6Hhi_9EIWFFbv1XNfygeu_EG3tDbRNT0f1Ze8_z5r6RRWiVkflGVne2tuVQUkF1MRPlkx6kDyOU2IR4sVmytToXaqzshHkwuACq4eGmG9zfoNWDfrLVqTxF9kQlXjbCRA88Yz6i8c9rlwG3LtPV_TpHDE_ebGJjzXgnjIGE9P0LijX98jx7ogZWjMocah4prRsMO7Q?authuser=0&fife=s16383
