    <Placemark>
      <name>Mjóeyri (winter only)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://mjoeyri.is Small family guesthouse and travel business. They welcome campers to sleep on their lot in the wintertime and offer good facilities. However in the summer they are usually fully booked in the guesthouse and reserve the facilities for them, so travelers on campers are sometimes not allowed in the high season. Great option for the wintertime though with very personal atmosphere. Facilities: - Toilet - Shower (included) - Hot tub (included) - Tourist information - Restaurant - Kitchen facilities
