        <coordinates>-13.99229,65.059972,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>The Freezer Hostel &amp; Culture Centre</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.thefreezerhostel.comThe Freezer hostel and culture center is a contemporary hostel that offers art, culture, live music, bar and most importantly camping for campervans all year ! It's not a traditional campsite and campers are parked in the parking lot next to the building, however they cannot guarantee availability in the high season (July-October) due to the hostel being fully booked usually. However in the off season it's a great option for campervans as there aren't many other campsites in the area, and they offer excellent facilites and services. They also offer very cheap acommodation in the winter, so if the weather is really bad it's not much more expensive to book a room vs paying to camp. Summer 2023: Due to limiter availability, starting May 1st, Freezer campsite will only be able to receive a maximum of 4 campers per day. The price increases to 49 EUR for two people in a camper and an additional fee of 20 EUR if there are 3 guests. The campsite won't be able to accommodate campers that contain more than 3 passengers. The restrictions will apply during summer months. To book online visit thefreezerhostel.com Price: 2,500 ISK per person. Facilities: - WC - Showers - Kitchen area - Bar - Cool living room area - Washing machine (Kr. 2000) - Live music on weekends in low season
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGR_Ziwgt97NTkjYKxxsXCvLINNEmctKvdpZMHT0usZEZpsodOuicrsBbdBHe79whS4-padidPAT1Org-5unSWrLm1iIKehicSbnblPnH9j5Plwxrf1lDtRGNn6Kr3J9G8e8eAhn0DVDAZ3nkaz7_0KfLagZLz2dWodkJ0nqi2vh3RudBPFfUc7ko0jQ9CaRtGbTdDIwXzREbD_AL1yM7evUXnEPiJUpfV4jumNC4-6SObXFpmGZUfRsEy4?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://www.thefreezerhostel.comThe

