    <Placemark>
      <name>Camping 66.12 NORTH</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/RfCuok1GxgNWC5zD6 Lovely campsite and the only one open in the north-east over the wintertime. Nice kitchen equipped with everything you'll need. A few tables in a heated area where you can dine or hang out. Included showers. Price: 1500 ISK, 0-15 year olds: Free Facilities: -Showers -Kitchen - Electricity (700 ISK) -Washer (600 ISK) -Dryer (600 ISK) -Museum
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQE70__6giB_USB2bVLLiAlAyrNFR6UZ5x_tbFvcCJAz489PzNp2qfAEtNNl60ti5fEU6DhkCbTSik7tFHG4yb5pvcMUCl6Gzyj8aqCltEXC2EvI3AzHFIiryVnDGHHmh0VkMCj_hKENVhl9ULbw-_xSOnPHBLjJ61Aa1TyXISvqqXX9q8cPjRGxUZ1bpTKD4k4kSciOIpkAcCgLG0WFFKGDOEa9eMCQuE81MDM5ftjT0Z99Pp54P9A_T0?authuser=0&fife=s16383
