      <Point>
        <coordinates>-17.105428,66.201298,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Hellishólar</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/hellisholar/ Hellisholar is about 10km from the town Hvolsvöllur and offers nice amenities for campers with a large play area for kids and soccer lovers. In wintertime the camping area closes but you are still welcome to park outside the bathing house overnight and use those facilities. Phone: 487-8360 Price: Kr. 2300/adult (2200 if you book online, under 12 free) Facilities: - WC - Shower (Included) - Electricity (Kr. 1600) - Water - Washer/dryer - Hiking trails - Playground - Restaurant - Golf course - Fishing - Playground
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGShL61BQyGqkxmf7oQTIisnhzF2vZykdwldJc5TZnRUpjPIN_YI1TuD9YOSpVZcbVHi4gCUjHoU57pKLph_Igmaw8qjSnTKm8zw424r72v_6LYNR9ObC1r5Nyv1ZoEssdyjkwqWlt8mc5ewvXzmp4QdZbAv19WbgDWepGkL7FRgNjoH3e3t-PWeqys5QqTUojSbTR3EScWf9A0rOUQEdd4F9DiJLH5sUS6jNAkz1wNAkATZlTKehQYIv-w?authuser=0&fife=s16383
