      <styleUrl>#style_Campsites___Mountain_Huts</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-21.406753,64.654835,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Grundarfjörður Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/grundarfjordur/ A campsite with beautiful surroundings and a marvelous view, located next to the swimming pool. Wheelchair accessible bathroom with electricity for campers. Open all year. In winter time campsite offers minimal facilities with WC and electricity. Information center for the campsite is at the swimming pool. Phone: +354 8993043 Adults: 1,600 ISK Seniors and disabled: 1100 ISK Free for 16 years and younger 15% off if staying three days or more. 25% off if staying six days or more. Facilities: - WC - Showers (during opening hours) (500 kr) - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Water - Garbage disposal - Hiking trails - Playground - Store access (09-20)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGT-oEKqyUDmjm5DnPMYirz0ocK1M9YYcb80QCxVlx_jYiOmycxrrVvem2JC4KNXJwSjUJP3N2S7t2cZ0345Jo2be__6izIFRLJ8upPXggMgUMq2FvqgxJW4jKIeDcSPMtQn0r0CaIDeEwbHW9653Utflq7pWx0hiKgnZXpWFT5AxqOp7gQX7XZElXkSbd4IcSfx4c_iD6tlKZnijRoiLhgLGdzUqrcBC30wW9jidt0lwN4eAUA5gKYI86g?authuser=0&fife=s16383
