      <name>Vogar Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/Y2DiNT5BRfq1qj1F6 This small town in Reykjanesbær recently opened a minimal campsite on what used to be a soccer field. It has a small service building with bathrooms, basic cooking facilities, etc. It's really close to other interesting attractions and towns, like the Blue Lagoon and Sandgerdi, not to mention the international airport. - Phone: 4406220 - Open: all year - Price: ISK 2000/adult. Children Free. - WC - Pool/hot tub (in town) - Cooking facilities - Electricity 1000 ISK - Water - Store access (in town)
