    <Placemark>
      <name>Fossatún Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/fossatun/ A small family owned hotel, restaurant and campsite located in the west part of Iceland. Price: Per unit (camper) 2-5 persons per unit. Summer price 3200 ISK open space per unit. 4000 ISK private space per unit. Winter price. 3200 all units. SPECIAL OFFER: Happy Campers customers get 10% off all accommodation. Access to: - Toilets - Showers - Hot tubs - Laundry - Wifi in common areas - Electricity on campsite - Playground for kids - Troll garden (family fun) - Minigolf (summer only) - Huge vinyl collection at the cafe. Guests make the playlist. - Rock ´n´ Troll Cafe & Restaurant on site
