    <Placemark>
      <name>Þakgil Campground</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://happycampers.is/thakgil-campsite/ Þakgil is a very scenic campground located about 14 kilometers away from highway 1. The road is accessible for non-4x4 vehicles although it requires some slow and careful driving in some areas. Lots of beautiful hiking routes are available in the area and on good summer days the weather can be amazing due to it being surrounded by mountains. Open: June 1st - September 15th Price: ISK 2,300 Tel: (+354)893-4889. Facilities: -Shower (Included in price) -Toilets - Indoor eating area - Electricity (ISK 1000)
