      <name>Borðeyri Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/borgarnes/ Borðeyri Camping site is located in the end of the village near the beach. The you find nice camping site with toilets and place to wash up. Hot and cold water, electrical connectors and barbecue. Nearby is nice playground for children. Phone: +354 849 7891 Price: Kr. 1000/adult (Free for 14 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Electricity (Kr. 600) - Water - Hiking paths - Playground
