    <Placemark>
      <name>Laugar Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/laugar/ This area is rich in history and the cozy campsite is located next to a hotel. You will find a small swimming pool right by the campsite as well as Guðrúnarlaug, a natural hot spring. The restaurant at the hotel is highly recommended! Phone: 444 4930 Price: N/A Facilities: - WC - Restaurant - Water - Hiking paths - Pool/hot tub - Electricity (Kr. 800)
