    <Placemark>
      <name>Flatey Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/flateyri/ Flatey is the most famous island of Breidarfjörður. The church on the island is decorated with paintings of the artist Baltasar and has recently been renovated. Tourist information, a restaurant and an area for camping are all things that you find on the island. During the summer, the ferry Baldur makes two stops at Flatey each day. https://www.youtube.com/embed/WqyXNTOTpvY
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRaG-bzh_q7niSBMPCxHPoLimOBapDBInSIYcGHJlHL1_5lxQ7E_eN5EwiXXKyjljipRqkuRHgQMtq-IfuHWsL7eugblM2dnecZ_FDx7vRJYdLXW_AgNuhB8nKzMOdAC12Qf40GMxpDbuWvW882AELsQ-ULyC8lSq3dXsDHUIwy9b1NbLKQQ92hHmOshaR4M2VWiIHy0egtt1AohdJLpzo1poTlXTtrspqOS2ykSqabpKymbPkMuzDKV30?authuser=0&fife=s16383
