      <Point>
        <coordinates>-22.919174,65.373852,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Hrísey Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/e1tUtbLAC2n5eWq3A The campsite in Hrísey is right below the sports center/swimming-pool. The campsite is close to the sea with easy access to go sea swimming as well as visiting the geothermal swimming pool and gym facilities in the sport center. The playgrounds by Hrísey primary school and downtown area are also close by for the younger generation to enjoy. The staff at the sport center/pool manage the campsite and serve the front desk duties. Their opening hours are Mon-Fri 10:30-18:30 and Sat-Sun 10:30-17:00. Showers and bathrooms (with cold and warm water) are in the basement of the sport center - with direct access from the campsite. Price per person/night is 1.500 ikr. and free for 17 years and younger that stay with their families. Charge for Electricity is 1.000 ikr. 24h. Price for seniors is 1.200 ikr. Campsite is open from 1st of June until 31st of August.
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQX6AYkYpAlVtrMmDGWo0fGGHEwGlq-TeOCgQwU2Qy6cGgZBhEyhajm_UmW70cSd08Y3OLjiROIJ0WKqLqYBhlidPoET_Hmk454R2pfU3aP7vqIUGv1k82XDwE9pGldMmLHSLUv8Pgum9DYP-T8Mvz0jSqpr_9cjHuoLe-N8ENmiTpTBFD0BGgU39lQYeBaSCUdEeOluxXrgmmPsegHhWLR6l1YZY_6UrIczLoMzGh6lfLs-EX9CIL_36U?authuser=0&fife=s16383
