    <Placemark>
      <name>Bjarkarlundur Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/o4VaXRRGpXwNXZg59 The campsite is situated just outside the hotel, on a grass field next to a small stream. It offers everything a camper might need in terms of service and location.From Bjarkarlundur guests can travel into various directions such as south to Reykholar, North to Holmavik and Isafjordur. Tel: +354 562 1900 -Service house with toilets and showers -Electricity plugs available -Few steps from the restaurant and shop at Hotel Bjarkalundur -Playground for children -Fishing lake nearby Campsite prices: ISK 1.500,- per person Electricity ISK 1.000,- per night Shower ISK 100,- per minute Children 12 years and younger stay for free
