    <Placemark>
      <name>Flókalundur Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/QMGNcRhhyaxkzmM57 Flókalundur campsite offers a great view over the fjord and is located near the hotel. The facilities are decent for this area and you can even talk to the hotel staff if you need to wash your clothes. Opens 15 June Phone: +354 456 2011 Price: Kr. 1400/adult Free for children age 16 and younger Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Dogs allowed - Hiking paths - Showers - Washer/dryer (ask hotel staff)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGS0q5WDOngubR01h8Zqmhk9b-mU0AudDHCHGFhb3nQjrQWz0b2LnyulaCCZdwp3kyOFL8muMK_BE4Fi-XVaW1ttOdT9lZqiqaZDD2T4W0ARp8ZAC8pdWuiPPReg8jkpk3qWwqdEHPFHTgMRssFAFD--wqg8kbjHpK9a9JOnMKC5Ph7Yue34jzy8YtJ9JFgHdTqdEhCDlzJmPWv4LLbtEzWYNZK2vVeSyB_aM2-kqQQfxLYNLVGdDuZmEGM?authuser=0&fife=s16383
