    <Placemark>
      <name>Patreksfjörður Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/patreksfjordur/ The town Patreksfjörður has a good selection of restaurants and coffee houses plus retail stores and other services. There is a lot of activities for the family scuh as the pirates house. The sports center also has a swimming pool that has one of the best view in the country. The magnificent nature in the area offers many possibilities both on your own and also in planned excursions. A touirst informatione center is also in the area. Close by is the famous beach Rauðisandur where you can find some seals, the largest bird cliff in Europe Látrabjarg, the famous valley Selárdalur and one of the more beautiful waterfalls in Iceland Dynjandi. The new camp site in the town Patreksfjordur is located next to the community center and is very visible when entering the town. The community center has good facilities that are of use for the guests of the camp site such as toilets, showers, washing machine, tumble dryer and cooking facilities. There is electricity and waste disposal for mobile homes. There is also a toilet and shower for the disabled. Open 15 May - 30 September Phone: +354 456 2380 Price: Adults (18 and older): 1.540 per person Senior citizens and handicapped: 1.230 per person 3 night stay: 3.230 per person Week stay: 7.530 per person Accommodation tax will be added to the price. Facilities: - WC - Electricity (Kr. 1330/day) - Water - Shower - Washing machine (Kr. 1440) - Cooking facilities - Restaurant - Dogs allowed - Hiking paths - Pool/hot tub - Waste disposal
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGT-Q9Vb19obS9tQjheWQihTs0OItanshCvEOa-nwArcN_OuKmfQ74qQCBYLO2xQru217V2JlfubnQh_J3UlT3I8xbjmP3qeW-trduyoIWKPS74aT1KH5hWR9tPHV6RPVU0iSTEPDMlOS5FdLSkVXVo6VLRsDH8fNTRWmRBy7LXIOv4QdFs92cRiG2hsCoF3v0GwU4leizx4YXTGcI0ibSHsV4ORjERmbm17_MpMuyGvlNbVqSqe5yyjKUk?authuser=0&fife=s16383
