    <Placemark>
      <name>Breiðavík Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/breidavik/ https://www.youtube.com/embed/rl-L_Qn6Fmc This is the closest campsite to the Látrabjarg bird cliffs, offering breathtaking views. At the campsite there is a fully loaded bath house with hot showers, flushable toilets, sinks, coin washer and dryer. Access to a kitchenette is available along with a BBQ grill. Several electricity plugs are on the site for RV’s and trailers. There is a free internet and free coffee and tea. This is a perfect site for families of all sizes. Phone: +354 456 1575 Price: Kr. 2400/adult (Free for 12 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - WiFi - Shower - Washing machine - Waste disposal - Cooking facilities - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGT_XsfbGZTCiT80pt0PKA2qB7NOxG_I5JAi1HjnghgY21SDE0QGQBUKK6rxqaZP8uwBtjllorazfpEoK7-jM4Gw3srJn4_hbTD3SscGjFhRoldXBEgBhTjk8khFXk8rbBMKwrctBCILwhxGap2Ucr1L-CfjFw10oY3x23h1daWTjmDhDGGjTfIT9kEb16UZVdX8lJaT2LoiV9GpkNSDMiKEZr_Q9yWQFXL-G9z4UujKTr8iC_u3P7GTDI0?authuser=0&fife=s16383
