    <Placemark>
      <name>Hnjótur Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/z2zcMwoU8LZB47TE7 A simple campsite with basic bathroom facilities and hot/cold water. It is very close to several interesting attractions, such as Látrabjarg bird cliffs and Hnjótur Museum. The previous farmer of the farm Hnjotur, Egill Olafsson († October 25th 1999) spent a large portion of his life collecting various items and articles of local and national historical importance for his museum. His interest and emphasis was for many reasons oriented towards the aviation history of the country. Phone: +354 456 1596 Price: Unknown Facilities: - WC - Water
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRGQn0XBL7Rl5rG07zHdeQnfIPVmj4g_PE1Jhqc16BKI-m-ThPwCIyOTX7s3f-9OdQO41IHA162psJmlJJMArbp-eMRirL9UkUejQuuRu10wLTIBWi4KABlA1wGM_nT2AzUQdwqR4cPa1wIypIQorYmBzF5n401ctloNveXCbAZAAS0_D-43oIUH3Z8hiBOOkY2rIUXMrfo9BbVXYYlnJ99jxzqVA5OAovGidywMKcRQ-s71lQUG36gNOQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383
