    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Bíldudalur Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/bildudalur/ The camping site at Bildudalur is located next to the towns sporting fields. The site has flushing toilets, coin washer and dryer, dump station and electricity. Bíldudalur lends itself to various activities. There is the unique Monster museum as well as the music museum. It is possible to take shorter and longer trips by boat, sailing or fishing. There are also many beautiful and interesting attractions close by such as the valley Selárdalur and the museum about Jón Sigurðsson in Hrafneyri. The beautiful nature offers many possibilities to go on your own but there are also many planned excursions close by. Attractions close by are for example the waterfall Dynjandi, a hot spring in the fjord Reykjafjörður, the beach Rauðisandur, the largest bird cliffs in europe Látrabjarg and much more. Open 1 June - 31 August Phone: +354 450 2354 Price: Kr. 1850 (Free for 15 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Hiking paths - Dogs allowed - Electricity (Kr. 1300) - Washer/dryer (Kr. 1400)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSJnUQxHXzTu3UM33VcUhPUhJX5982u_BvwXzFtABRVt3vpzknlb0SX5rrQ5o6k2kUaB8pmP7BXWQWCY3kpE19wPm2bMUWfXT5zs9PWMGLTVi-AqbBUd_xQQk76n95boGH3sW9A3f8XQy8XJzpfV0I3opfINEV_eGzH_3uwqVhJ8Is8jHTp9njdLbxT0ntSjwW0AdbcjsjuoQD-Xd3me1NUsjQjcrD9vpbfi-asXkFdnm_bLLOz3U9Uq3g?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/bildudalur/

