      <styleUrl>#style_Campsites___Mountain_Huts</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-23.603044,65.683611,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Flateyri Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/flateyri/ The town Flateyri is a typical Icelandic fishing village that has based its income and survival from the sea. It only has a population of approx. 300 people. In Flateyri travelers will find all the service they need. Swimming pool, sports hall, shopping and restaurants are all within 5 minutes walking distance from the camp site. The camp site is located right below the avalanche protection wall. The inner area of this wall situates a sheltered area for outdoor recreation and grilling facilities. From top of the Avalanche wall, the view is breathtaking over Flateyri and Önundarfjörður. The campsite is by the N1 gas station and just a short walk from the swimming pool and local restaurant. Phone: +354 848 0920 Price: Kr. 1300/adult (Free for 16 and younger) Facilities: - Electricity 1000 Kr. - WC - Playground - Cold Water
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSzRnf-nOco0l2LV16ci1k3GUTkqxD0rI4jnqqH_aCH0hH5HN1WgtlubtN7KVCsInKx2qcwexW6isFfWZsYKB_ki_KMdvc5mA6RsOblw7WWTEZE8GBMTmPQjz3h63tcJlNvlzTjN0hzrQ6bIUuen8x23yThd2cScT1-Ve20KcetwgxgUjWUguoziMz3CS3kabl1wvH9MJB5Z_jYgR8C-SjyRLcu8iRyP3wjgPl6AFTkBIqTlkgyr7xHGCg?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/flateyri/

