      <styleUrl>#style_Campsites___Mountain_Huts</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-23.510452,66.051815,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Melanes campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.melanes.com Melanes is located at the southernmost part of the Westfjords in Iceland. They have a campsite next to a beautiful beach with a view of the largest known bird cliff in the world, Látrabjarg is a home to millions of birds. In walking distance from the campsite is a seal habitat . Melanes is also a great place for hiking. Open from May 15th until September 15th. Prices: 1.500 kr per night/person 17 years and older Facilities: - WC - Showers (included in the price) - Kitchen - Electricity (1000 kr.)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQPeYdjgakMOAJMlkbbJVTVUhYY1unPWfegM9_EUj20sa50bTY3eA-rjijnz-aObe-rUs0rFiW0cLF_eCznP3Vm2tL3Y7o5NyFmrjHEV2ete-puzhu6cG_cnLFg4hgANnOiZWJAqXD8YtEPxapBCySudVm254ldXTpiaMr2oim1Qt-rQJk1tJ7mGOX5yTlREEetz1CWajhdX1Q7gd6MxbGbAzOdXt6a72Yr6Zx6E439qITAww98Vp7Zf0I?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://www.melanes.com

