      <styleUrl>#style_Campsites___Mountain_Huts</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-23.952607,65.445128,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Tungudalur Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/tungudalur/ This is Isafjordur's primary campsite. A great deal of work has been completed on the site in effort to enhance its natural beauty and services provided. The site is covered in and around by trees that give shelter on windy days. The camp site is about 900 m away from Skutulsfjarðarbraut. Bunárfoss passing through the area and divide it into two parts, the second part is intended for campers, caravans and trailers and the other part is intended for tents. The area has good access to electricity, smooth surface and the area is very sheltered in. There are two service buildings. The upper house is the reception, toilets and showers. Lower house was built in 2011, is to find women and men grading, showers, bathrooms with shower deemed disabled and washing machine and dryer. There is also a kitchen with hob, microwave, toaster, pressure cookers and dining area. There is also a playground for children. Phone: +354 864 8592 Price: Kr. 1800/adult (Free for 17 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Electricity (Kr. 1200) - Water - Shower - Washing machine - Cooking facilities - Hiking trails - Playground - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQ3nukV_0Cxe1EooPUj1u_hOK5AEZKs3g1v9r8EPdAwBnkz05MVrdCLI8-s1reBaMGfSwWA7OujNOt7n8G9BXsLKemDuFoKCvnsVrA6HnHsJruDdk1rfASrnaGZjZuH0QylGt5A14lNvG3DIsDX5npDcUBeBZ_rdePbU_RxKYGku8ld7Nc7u1yzmeXYM7yacu-paAdEpA3jveIZ51awzI5GsKJt2YXEJr2y_cIIeW2L5ZMBCNfqjeWcSHc?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/tungudalur/

Commentaire: Style: icon:1765,color:000000 | gx_media_links: https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQ3nukV_0Cxe1EooPUj1u_hOK5AEZKs3g1v9r8EPdAwBnkz05MVrdCLI8-s1reBaMGfSwWA7OujNOt7n8G9BXsLKemDuFoKCvnsVrA6HnHsJruDdk1rfASrnaGZjZuH0QylGt5A14lNvG3DIsDX5npDcUBeBZ_rdePbU_RxKYGku8ld7Nc7u1yzmeXYM7yacu-paAdEpA3jveIZ51awzI5GsKJt2YXEJr2y_cIIeW2L5ZMBCNfqjeWcSHc?authuser=0&fife=s16383

