    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Dalbær Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/dalbaer/ Dalbær Campsite offers a stunning view over the Ísafjarðardjúp fjord. This is what Lisa said of Dalbær: "This is a fantastic, off-the-beaten-trail place to stay in the west fjords of Iceland! My sister and I spent a few nights here because we'd discovered our great grandmother had been born in Snæfjallaströnd - and we could have spent many more happy days and nights here. The host and hostess are lovely, and helpful if you are here to hike, and the food they offer is absolutely delicious! I highly recommend a stay. I´ll be going back again this year for certain!" Open From 10 June to 11 July Phone: +354 783 6600 Price: Younger than thirteen years get free camping but pay for the shower Camping with access to toilet and shower ISK 2000 Electricity for motorhome, caravan ISK 1000 Facilities: - WC - Water (cold) - Electricity - Shower 500 isk - Restaurant - Hiking path - Washing machine 500 isk
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSIPD65hNj2YGb2BdsDEhG5xwGoL2aIWYpzzEW8uH5FgMaRGFRIVJjnePKYtmtzsaG9AHxxmUOI1Pab4aM2afL6t5-Rle6Bn66Kcl5t6i9Slww-to_RHj1tMLJx5iVvKnnq75XhKynI_ntn5lCGrnDJG-LvzzibvH6gctB8JFEiq1fyfKbjzNLu-gvcFKoGLt_zXVi9axzw8tm9JaBgKK0JQstI2gKyGnAU1IQPcsCkEf1Rw2u6VOoX-z0?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/dalbaer/

