    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Kaffii Kjos (Hjalli)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.hjallikjos.is/en/services/ Kaffi Kjós is a small farm, 50 km from Reykjavik, overlooking Meðalfellsvatn lake. You will find a small store and restaurant there. The campsite provides access to restrooms, showers, outside sink, electricity, and a small sandbox for the kids. Phone: +354 566 7019 / +354 566 8099 Price: Kr. 2000/adult Facilities: - WC - Showers - Electricity (1000 kr) - Water - Restaurant - Store access
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQfB1yn8QZt49KTZD2fVER7Fo5cSXuzDsSzRWofeJIfNhD96ikQoeortgqo9wEr07wsO6533AgHpJQV9N1ROqjfF3RKdMV48P1Rst6ZrN2_aqRYhTiGrqvPbHHuwBZTMYQ9P6ub2-vC9IX7y4w6sRswkLRf0H2i7AsSvDonvHd6JGbtwzgm-36tvQxHs_Uq_P_VGwdzSUUOjFo2tKfV1sH9KMFrIhcmIwvAcqrVp_Evz-job30IO3ip8L8?authuser=0&fife=s16383
