    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Ófeigsfjörður Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.northbound.is/nl/attraction/ofeigsfjordur This campsite is located on an old field of grass with only basic facilities. You will find a bathroom with running water but not much more. But the surroundings are beautiful and if you're just looking for a peaceful place to park your camper overnight, this might be a good stop. This campsite is as close to "unspoiled nature" as a campsite will get. Many people start or end their hikes at this campsite, as it is near Hornstrandir and many beautiful hiking paths: Phone: +354 852 2629 Price: Unknown Facilities: - WC - Water - Hiking paths
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGS1l9OmTWQJo5aCddrRXmwOu4dAyK_BQaow9d0qFk97JJpP6bSOlNjrzU19C504hRn5xr3_Bx_0ApegSpHD8uAIiDx_AAJW2VQogzN3eker-r5symueGc-OsEd6ZxpBNLKHu0ol6iiasDsRyfTD5VwDvZvhvzpLrXMEF2Lc98bu7qPC7i8QLeYjtctnDm_NoNinf8RsV7cJ8ctrdVskt4f20vl2gEGDdtni0ImXZDFvQPy3FRowR-M3_Kc?authuser=0&fife=s16383
