    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Urdartindur Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/urartindur-norurfiri/ https://www.youtube.com/embed/93hoB4FwU58 The Urðartindur camp site is large, and has all the necessary facilities. Guests have access to a large hall with cooking facilities, tables and chairs, toilets, electricity, BBQ, and much more. It is located by and run by the guesthouse and is only 4 km from the famous Krossneslaug geothermal pool. Phone: +354 843 8110 Price: Kr. 1500/adult (Free for kids) Facilities: - WC - Water - Cooking facilities - Electricity - BBQ area - Hiking paths
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSY1l3pXtJS6mERoWwj41FUdIalvwl1pJc2nSuI-7X3-If4X3pEqgHduW4Q32EIeuAx0eW1UKFap3G2hP8osGvhLB9qv6DvR4NvxEuIt_vcuR9gVjEEToyDywPqgC7PqzbSQMKmLYDN4J5kyFAe_dH1Sga0Qg5igHdouQX-SWbTGjvJgt5S_L4DFsp0rjLlg8ogTa29yFxyXj0eBgR7kBWGTGkYbbke6o_YR7IuYD0LuZUty3Ules7H1GI?authuser=0&fife=s16383
