    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Valgeirsstaðir Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/valgeirsstadir/ This campsite is located on a farm and offers plenty of fantastic hiking paths but limited facilities. Phone: +354 568 2533 Price: Kr. 2000/adults Those using FÍ's facilities, such as toilet or outdoor grill, but not staying overnight are charged a facility fee. 500 KR Facilities: - WC - Water (cold) - Shower (Kr. 500)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRSkDj5bfneWc3eSgrqyCeouUcozK_XxDZFPC-8Qc4YZ8KxdRzClnrKcgBjWB74d2mzZVWZjzaA_2JgXVMvSOpe_vasC_LL2o_7L7VnfHMjfpnGyh9jwp8Mfn9xRSvDMQ7so4V12bqn2Iy4kSQBjOM_EvO7RIvy-T3jiwooBxtr6wxAE7AuZBhcFJKy_K2yYZFB_QEdCO4uDWOCwp2wTgEVDwuPnzxRa3E3FE3PDP8WUa-3po3viSj5PD8?authuser=0&fife=s16383
