    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Sandgerdi Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://airportcamping.is This campsite is located by the iStay (istay.is) cabins in Sandgerdi. Sandgerdi is a small fishing village that offers a nice location for those who are exploring the Reykjanes peninsula. It's also only about 7 minutes from Keflavik International airport. The gorgeous ocean views don't hurt either. Even though the population is only about 1,500 people, you'll find most of what you need there, such as a grocery store, swimming pool, and a nice seafood restaurant. Check out vitinn.is for more info about that. It consists of a service building that has handicap accessible bathrooms and showers, and even a washer and dryer. - Phone: 8548424 - Open: April 1st - September 30th - Price: 1800 ISK for adults Seniors/disabled 1500 ISK Kids (13-16) 1000 ISK - WC - Showers - Pool/hot tub (close by) - Electricity (1000 ISK) - Water - Washing machine/fryer (500 ISK each, dryer only n/a). - Playground - Store access
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQgIUJS9E4l9p4JcHo6DUFlijZdy3qVhC5WSQfcLYyoGuuajz5vuL8-D-5lLUWxhDSauMcGSjU1XsUI1mAOfURGG__nWQwehgPb7cEwsAIEcNY-aiz0YgXec9MLMpnpCCzxvlPDPymHU2PPfb5JVfsIblFekxFdqefH0uKghASV_anHuGcwo3RiRAhUtB8va62AGx7GeQKBlAjXRseloy-S8eLB7y2fKAvnCjEmMwtzGqowffNHpwjBGx0?authuser=0&fife=s16383
