    <Placemark>
      <name>Varmaland Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/varmaland/ The Varmaland camping site is situated at the outskirts of the municipality of Skaftholtstungur in Borgarfjörður fjord. It is situated between two rivers i.e. Hvítá River and Norðurá River. A sport center is located at Varmaland and it is open from late June to the middle of August. The center also has a swimming pool which is popular among campers. The camping site itself is large and perfect for groups and families. Hiking trails are many and diverse. Driving directions: Take the ring-road towards the mountain Baula and turn on to Borgarfjarðarbraut road (50) drive for about 2,5 kilometers and turn on to Varmalandsvegur road. Drive another 2,5 kilometers and you are there. Open from June 1st - August 17th, Phone: +354 775 1012 Price: Kr. 1500/adult 0-15 years: free Facilities: - WC - Electricity (Kr. 900) - Water - Playground - Hiking paths - Dog friendly - Pool/hot tub Restaurant
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQL-ZuII4P4LVanPOfuX9cJp-cMK6CwSOFWHOlYah-z_1gPvDH0fdC3LCCN5L8y6YHqH3GoS2uWiXZfBurWtofrGOvIGNu_hqP_taYn1plW2QZoiTGj0zWn-vlDmNoPdpaQAV90gDlim-lC8flBFw2FnB2sJFJoFx6MGI5k6YdwtTfBV1mdf4CUqAomWJM4eXCmX-vkBIDaWj16sIEvFpINbSa-eeg49EoCmOjaqyItGsPTK_6hBygRiYM?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/varmaland/

Commentaire: Style: icon:1765,color:000000 | gx_media_links: https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQL-ZuII4P4LVanPOfuX9cJp-cMK6CwSOFWHOlYah-z_1gPvDH0fdC3LCCN5L8y6YHqH3GoS2uWiXZfBurWtofrGOvIGNu_hqP_taYn1plW2QZoiTGj0zWn-vlDmNoPdpaQAV90gDlim-lC8flBFw2FnB2sJFJoFx6MGI5k6YdwtTfBV1mdf4CUqAomWJM4eXCmX-vkBIDaWj16sIEvFpINbSa-eeg49EoCmOjaqyItGsPTK_6hBygRiYM?authuser=0&fife=s16383

