    <Placemark>
      <name>Lava Hostel</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://parka.is/hafnarfjordur/ If you are looking for a family friendly campsite near Reykjavik, Hafnarfjörður Camping is the place for you. The campsite is close to all services, shopping and many tourist attractions. City busses stop nearby, as well as the bus to Keflavik international airport. For those of you travelling by car, the airport is only a 30 minute drive away. We are situated in a beautiful park near the town centre of Hafnarfjörður, a quiet and cozy area. However, downtown Reykjavík is only a 10 minute drive away, so you still remain close to the action. You can also take bus number 1 straight from our campsite to downtown Hafnarfjörður or downtown Reykjavík. The campsite is open from the 15th of May to the 15th of September. Phone: +354 565 0900 Price: Kr. 1800/adult (1200 14-17 yeas, Free for 13 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Showers - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Washer/dryer (Free) - Cooking facilities - WiFi - BBQ area
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQ-vRoX7FoaBDPBCl6C271VZrHZCWLkDoaSUYgsOSqjDg0tMLOwNLRIfsI0Xb9nvbmxze5pf5blzugWWuyK34z4makE3VDzj70LXhd7SRpvjHWSDX7aA9TNh0dt87aTs7aEssOK5mZofXf8XR0roIYyMGbJ4N2RxY3Cqx9hpjaa7guCTOWdAgqmAJJpEDjI3AxLoj5rZkdgXfODvYB3OGvK-P1T7F6EuHyVm-3pBCXnX3SS27o2GabMfiY?authuser=0&fife=s16383
