    <Placemark>
      <name>Hlaðir - War and Peace Museum</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/hladir/ In the community center is a nice dance hall that can seat up to 200 person and fits well for large groups, family gatherings, conferences, concerts and much more. The hall has a large stage, a disco ball, piano, lectern, sound system, a nice bar and a spacious and well equipped kitchen. There is a catering service at Hlaðir and possible to serve food for large and small groups at a reasonable price. Hlaðir is far away in the country side but still only 40 minutes drive from Reykjavík. There is a large camp site at Hlaðir that can accommodate tents, folding campers, caravans and mobile homes. There is electricity and two barrel barbeques to use. Also a playground for the children. The toilet facilities are good with toilets, showers, waste disposal and facilities to wash the dishes. The swimming pool is on the east side of the community center with spacious locker rooms and a steam bath. The pool is 17 meters long and also has a childrens pool, waters slide and two hot tubs. It is possible to rent the swimming pool outside of usual opening hours. The opening hours are all days except tuesdays from 13:00 – 19:00. It is closed on tuesdays. The swimming pool is open from june 1st to the end of august. Phone: +354 660 8585 / +354 433 8877 Price: Kr. 1500/adult Kr. 800/children 4-14 yo free for children 0-4 yo Facilities: - WC - Water - Pool/hot tub - Shower - Waste disposal - Hiking paths
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSmC0JCNQfrjbm3r3fGOH6R6AaWKprYsT97QW9EtIrcW2AD6qLLpgO3k-a-8LpXix_UKV90Bw4YoSsI0D6RijTyIN_RzSiwG0_vsLETFkvoFcFhtkVBWf7NwxuQU6NM7lJdsvPi9j3zCP_NSbBJpBzIyNKNdEMRJqievRhW0bRQ5zoVLyVMSzUz8Fl1qn8YsfMNSnMfNMK31Kar_AvJrJKp2CpYjHZF6SQFLng_RKipWvaXYoC-I0fHuoY?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/hladir/

