    <Placemark>
      <name>Selsskógur Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/selskogur-skorradal/ Green and sheltered camping area next to the lake Skorradalsvatn. Hot and cold water, shower, WC and electricity on site and garbage container near by. Hreppslaug Swimming Pool and many marked trails along with mountains to climb nearby. This is a camping area for those who want comfort but at the same time be in a close contact to nature. Phone: +354 898 4907 / +354 789 8442 Price: Kr. 1300/adult Elderly and disabled Kr, 1100 0-15 year old children free Facilities: - WC - Water - Shower - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Pool/hot tub
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSsxyhIR9jmj0cWRK85zqFlpfGJwDRoJ74oZAgTG3WFjR56tn_bfvUMc_Gz47FsYxGnUIoOD94HQDNK8dtuGk_MP8LMXbvl2BbkY9lNcZ-N_7OicIJmwFuqDmjq5DX2tGzRmn05qiUAdU0nRejuOi1ID5HK1m0M9kyarcXqRlKmAKM3UK0447D3X8TOq4JGWWloDn3p0usgjsKC12IEQvYhgKchLEOYSsmnCNcXecVUrM5WfZUFXewvnhA?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/selskogur-skorradal/

