    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Arnarstapi Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/arnarstapi/ Arnarstapi is such a beautiful location in Snæfellsnes. Travelers can park their vans anywhere on the campsite. Price: 1500 ISK / person Children 13-17 yo: 700 ISK Children 0-12 yo: free Facilities: - WC - Shower 500 kr - Electricity (Kr. 1500) - Water - Garbage disposal - Hiking trails - WiFi
