      <name>Finnbogastadir</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/LPWgbf6q51yYH3Yk9 This campsite is located next to a small school and is good for campers who don't require many facilities and amenities. Phone: +354 451 4012 Price: unknown - Water (cold) - WC - Electricity
