    <Placemark>
      <name>Laugarhóll Hotel/Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/laugarholl/ https://www.youtube.com/embed/nc1TnqRM5Og This modest campsite is located next to Hotel Laugarhóll and offers bathroom facilities with hot and cold water. Next to the hotel you will find The Pool of Gvendur the good, a naturally warm geothermal outdoor swimming pool (32°C) and adjacent natural thermal spring (42°C), perfect for relaxing after a long day on the road or hiking in the wilderness. The pool was built in the fifties by the neighboring farmers and on the walls of the recently renovated dressing rooms is a small exhibition showing the making of the pool. Various hiking trails are close by, endless driftwood beaches ideal for long walks, horse rental, river-and deep sea angling and sailing trips to the lovely puffin island Grímsey. Phone: +354 451 3380 Price: Unknown Facilities: - WC - Water - Restaurant - Horse rental - Pool/hot tub
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSvFxcN8ujKPiZQImM3fLTcxR2q2Msa-5tGDwN7Ua2NQHsIatvq9bWKBR4o2NmzKcoPWNlrEyNR5TQQyIrAldnIbhzIYgd9vYHkBqZ4GRN_bUczt6HMNMyV3VCihPJeY2D54b4JM0V-U2JdL4OM73A-cnVR5iZxeeen1E3JLhlflN2YHXrO1n7Xqdt6v32DFfuFZeNNWjhICQyb2zUixx2jTyado_MAYOZ0mp3gXKtjEOHEu3JYT8_oNVg?authuser=0&fife=s16383
