      <name>Sæberg Campsite/Hostel</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.hostel.is/en/hostels/hi-saeberg This modest campsite is located by Reykjaskóli school and is a convenient stop between Reykjavik and Akureyri. Relax in the hot tub and enjoy the outside cooking facilities for a nice night of camping. Phone: +354 451 0015 / +354 894 5504 Price: Unknown Facilities: - WC - Showers - Electricity - Hiking paths - Water - Cooking facilities - Pool/hot tub
