    <Placemark>
      <name>Guesthouse/Campsite Langafit</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/langafit/ The camp site at Langafit is a small, cosy camp site with access to a hot tub and showers, washing machine and a tumble dryer. At the camp site is also a craftsman house with beautiful craftmansship as well as coffee and waffles. Phone: +354 451 2987 / +354 892 8487 Price: unknown Facilities: - WC - Water (cold) - Washing machine - Shower - Pool/hot tub - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRAjZedlbtUj3FZY3HzhS4T4LBsqfzwNAMPZMdpU3dwTENw3QyNZdbox6qC4Pc4uCrjjVpixGQU44QHOVjoZIIGuIc1zNAk30yIHtxuotPBYF9W_c-OvBjy1XzzgdJIFrKxT_AhdZd5RmkPF2OkckselcimVpRJrYbYhgue6Tovo-uqXF5ji_beLzr-f7qoBQJMku3PH-YdnNnAILhcQjP8KSkyfVx0Mmik-jJE8rBtZ6PLhlrtq6f0yEE?authuser=0&fife=s16383
