    <Placemark>
      <name>Húnavellir Campsite/Hotel</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/XPSGVvXMfaMHC5mS8 A good camp site with access to toilet facilities in Hótel Húni next to the camp site. At the hotel there is also a swimming pool with a hot tub. The camp site has few different places to camp at so it is possible for groups to be a little private. When it is very busy the football field is used. Phone: +354 456 4500 Price: Kr. 1900/adult (Free for 12 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Restaurant - Playground - Electricity - Dogs allowed - Hiking paths - Pool/hot tob - Shower
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTqqWrXz1gv8RYm8UiGL_ymZgR0_TGoPKiBK7aKAz7zwohPEmME_G-2GR0oMVlZh5O-XoveicFddG-5VcDtJIQJOYbGX5iI-utFq_8WAhWGAlTGVkBDn8WyWOrKsARm-HKSHBczM8POWrNyA71J1B66egbqVjw0Qfy_Rc8Oqm13x0BbI4BHf6O5tQDr40rqNlZhDxik5H8kqALMDKwlPDU_8Z4iAjZ8pUNPGpGpgbtsbxI0wZmrvRzvibg?authuser=0&fife=s16383
