        <coordinates>-20.20699,65.541407,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Skagaströnd Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/skagastrond/ The camp site is in a sheltered and quiet place facing the sun during the day. In the middle of the area there is a mound where an old farm used to be. The area is sheltered to the north and east by small cliffs called Hólaberg. In the service house there are toilets, washing machine and facilities to eat and do the dishes. Thera are also a lot of information for travellers such as two excellent pamphlets on walking paths on Spákonufellshöfða and the mountain Spákonufell. There is also a guest book that guests are asked to write their names in. Open May-enf of September (exact dates depends on the weather) Phone: +354 848 7706 Price: Kr. 1500/camper (Kr. 1200/seniors and disabled) Facilities: - WC - Showers (Kr. 500) - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Water - Playground - Washer/dryer (Kr. 400) - Hiking paths - Golf course - Pool/hot tub - Waste disposal - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQhSXEflt4p7e_8Bj8iJdObz4Jo_zhQE6tDLq5f08Htind3cPvoJtugqlii-3bLaNErTaC6Ar1pqjkkNjFZV0sWQhL5S_EkIrEW8T9H9wRrmbdqSkOPIg4O98HoJQoVAutDI4-YrxRoPQHjHPPrbAoTOFzT3lN5C5dH-iSDxgKUMT0LbPkyHNKQBnaICV727pd-ZrHPFJvcbQNY4bgM3rrjIzWk41jbU3xpOpq8P_I1xcJHXQUU74Aff7Q?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/skagastrond/

