      <styleUrl>#style_Campsites___Mountain_Huts</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-19.738864,65.879859,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Sauðárkrókur Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/saudarkrokur/ The Sauðárkrókur camping site is located in the area by the local swimming pool. Skagafjörður valley offers many great locations and tourist attractions such as museums, historic sights, golf courses, horse riding or horse shows, sport fishing in various lakes or rivers or hiking in the beautiful nature. Close by there is river rafting as well as an opportunity to sail to the historic site Drangey Island, which is highly recommended. There is great bird life in Skagafjörður and furthermore, this is the area which prides itself of having one of the greatest numbers of Icelandic horses. The camping site has a newly built service house that is facilitated with hot and cold showers, toilets, and a washing machine. Electricity can be purchased at the site and toilets can be emptied on site. The town of Sauðárkrókur offers all the necessary services, swimming pool, shops, restaurants, bars and a golf course. The camp site is open from the 15th of May until the 16th of September sooner or later as the weather allows. Phone: +354 899 3231 Price: 1500 ISK Per person first day 1300 ISK Per person every additional night 1300 ISK Per pensioner(age 67+) first day 1100 ISK Per pensioner every additional night Children 12 years and younger Free of charge Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity 800 kr. - Shower 250 kr. - Washing machine 500 kr - Dryer 500 kr. - Pool/hot tub - Restaurant - Store access - Golf course - Playground - Hiking paths - Fishing - Horse rental - Waste disposal - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSRDFqrmYHle4j70FDBpMi-OLvyvAvt-6K8GhaKDh2cKzfxRrEZoFqD3MEzpa35T1n5XqZ7z-53bNKz9fT5KZN2Pc3S3W1BFQP1_KgtgWKpA3f2h2bAqcnRGIco-lRA747rL0Sopt4Du-ZDSrgN3MGufZBy7P1UZyPInUOuRNxJ6JCqX2fVWa9mUGp3THzIhgYscAaKmICKBftfwYj66o8sNPBsD-TtYr_KstJPKXa79jjQt7T9z4c3EGQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/saudarkrokur/

