    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Bakkaflöt Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/Bakkaflot/ Beautiful campsite at the banks of the river Svartá. The campsite has a natural shelter for wind, hot and cold running water, a service building with cooking facilities, toilets and gas grills. Ideal for tents, motor-homes and caravans. Electric hook ups are available if needed. Phone: +354 453 8245 Price: Kr. 1600/adult (Free for 12 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Showers (Kr. 500 - includes hot tub) - Pool/hot tub - Cooking facilities - Electricity (Kr. 900)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGToRVNn_QTc18dTSKeJtHMHtdh0xN3nQkUaSpm-Zp9tZjQapXDjjZITy7ozuckcxM94ztvYuI7Kd8AkPYn9KogrEjbrZFu5QmuaHmBCUhX9iSYjTWrygRBOJCDc373TMlynEifsMMo_qhpvnKW98mkhZFKIESd71AMcvNMOgXBvvnNVcMIygFERS9keqeH3uyNLpE6VXwUixknLWkazdmqkdJkZqsaoa1QCdKQfeLEE0MW-gIKs4bfneHo?authuser=0&fife=s16383
