    <Placemark>
      <name>Hofsós Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[The camp site is sheltered with trees. There is electricity, toilets, shower and hot and cold running water. The camp site is a short distance from a new swimming pool at Hofsós that has received many awards for a great design. A good day is to have a swim in the swimming pool, get an icecream at Fjóluís in Lónkot, visit the Icelandic Emigration Center and have a dinner at Sólvík. It is also fun to go sailing around the islands or go fishing. The camp sites in the town Sauðárkrókur, Hofsós, Varmahlíð and at Hólar are operated together. It is possible to stay the first night in one of these camp sites and pay less during the next night in some of the other camp sites. It is necessary to provide a receipt from the first camp site. The camp site is open from the 15th of May until the 16th of September sooner or later as the weather allows. Phone: +354 899 3231 Price: 1500 ISK Per person first day 1300 ISK Per person every additional night 1300 ISK Per pensioner(age 67+) first day 1100 ISK Per pensioner every additional night (Free for 12 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Shower (kr. 250) - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Playground - Pool/hot tub - Dogs allowed

Commentaire: Style: icon:1765,color:000000

Altitude: 0.0m]]></description>
