      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Lónsá Gistiheimili / Lónsá Guesthouse</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://lonsa.is/is/heim/ The Lónsá camp site was opened in August 2015, and is located north of Akureyri about 3 km from the town center. The camp site is nice for tents, motorhomes and caravans. Electricity, showers, toilets and good facilities for dish washing also. There are good services nearby, information about activities and service can be found on the web site www.visitakureyri.is Phone: +354 462 5037 Price: Kr. 1500/adult (Free for 16 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Shower (Kr. 500) - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTDSkj3EWR2jd3GzgAwGCH14QX2YXXbXyyP8IMaTiorSTMS4OyoRNC3Z1zwMeniR0k4K4Yed7aZYdbUPjrwCuJHt7RtktIDG3h5Q03BG-hu6t6BiOVZQiiDtxoVENepLNVohfDqtGDtDohd6dlddB1wTIykMtAO9rvChpFtBKgdEkiPRKW53259xFt4Y4TAZfHT5tKAWDkHJWVQdJcudgwolwIbBCbHHrY0scQeuEWfeg9wY2l4ZbkWC2M?authuser=0&fife=s16383
