    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Húsabakki Campsite/Hostel</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/rhED9uP4Xma1gdoT8 The camp site is located in a beautiful location í the valley Svarfaðardalur and is surrounded by beautiful mountains. There is electricity for folding campers, caravans and mobile homes. Playground for the children, sports area and a small area in the forest to build a camp fire. It is possible to get access to a washing machine, a kitchen and an internet connection. On the lower floor of the community center there are good toilets and showers for camp site guests. All major services are a short drive away as well as recreation such as swimming pool, golf, horse rental, boat rental, bird waching, museums and much more. Phone: +354 859 7811 Price: Kr. 1500/adult (Free for 12 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Playground - Golf course - Hiking paths - Shower - Pool/hot tub - Washing machine - Horse rental - Waste disposal - Boat rental
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGR-KVhuA1TrZuAjkk2_KQ7Gt16K39LqvPCYzhcyqFyqkvMdETwT28C2yRIXY7uOPJS-pIJuVIMSPEDruupIFBY9ILcVpFaLJfkPbLHlQ_EdjSGbNqfDD3CFkw-zz4ZWjzPVQpaGpyGoleSD4Fewb0AWzdYxQDm2A2e7uhdEfJaHHggT4tVOMlqhXVK2j3MeDlaBpa7fc7KF0CfHN1U_qLgX4ywpTbpuFY-Gic4Net3dMPbHdIjETjW0enA?authuser=0&fife=s16383
