    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Dalvík Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/dalvik/ The campsite in Dalvík is situated close to Dalvík Swimming pool. The facilities include hot and cold water, showers, access to electricity and equipment for toilet waste from campers and caravans. There is a nice playground for children nearby, a fooball pitch, a basketball court and Dalvík swimming pool is only a few feet away. The swimming pool staff is responsible for the campsite during the Pool´s opening hours. Open 15th of may – 15th of september. Phone: +354 460 4940 Price: Kr. 2500/camper (Kr. 1700/tent). Rates do not apply during the "Great Fish Day" festival during the second week of August. Facilities: - WC - Water - Shower - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Playground - Washer and dryer (1000 Kr.) - WiFi - Hiking paths - Pool/hot tub - Waste disposal - Horse rental
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRGAFbEO30xH2v6SBaofWeD-Yfz-88RtUhZI4hP6BkwqozbDWxjJqAoMHzq3WucfIXefJGG8iZA5cCODlQ3reGWN1oVAlji44WAWEuIBZRJHI-Ik5x3nmgtiig4nyp_TXjq33kBcdoGlJcozIvloijtbeUAw-t-AjyofL8qYr2DSNytoVBLVXFAnPbMIC9RvkwQxFFkcmP5lBszzhTLTM96ZiLYc2fgKN-bG5n-DPZHmxrirVwuitbJ50A?authuser=0&fife=s16383
