      <styleUrl>#style_Campsites___Mountain_Huts</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-18.534943,65.967983,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Hrafnagil Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/K3jyku8e4qDNzEjDA The family camp site Hrafnagil is located next to the school in Hrafnagil, about 10 km from Akureyri. It has plenty of growth and natural beauty. Visitors are free from the racket of “city” life but still close to all services. Many walking paths are close by. The christmas house is a short walk away where you can experience the christmas spirit all year round. A short drive away you can also find the coffee house Holtsels Hnoss where you can buy coffee, icecakes and homemade icecream. Other activites close by are is a horse rental, golf courses, museums, galleries and much more. The facilities are quite good with toilets, playground, hot and cold running water, swimming pool next door and a washing machine. The craftsman festival is held yearly the second weekend in august. Phone: +354 464 8140 Price: Kr. 1500/adult (free for 17 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Playground - WiFi - Hiking paths - Pool/hot tub - Shower - Waste disposal - Washing machine - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSFJtOaHec_lpz5VtO4pAc5DwfChaciFcFx7NnhM__GoamQJxpVLFttVKbcTi7aukPwJNHieX4QtFhoKyUV6F1rYYAQBYOAZfQl1TKZMhZ0Wr6K3T3cFvttiE8SnJ1Whxpvl-yktHsIbSIFmVug4o7cMx8m3odV5nYhGaW4DzBw6rYLZ5RrQVgp6qWsm6AZ-2eCcq8gz6tcHSOUasHeNM0ieRSzJYnRfFXgwSXzDsa14K58EdDuTq3Bh88?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://goo.gl/maps/K3jyku8e4qDNzEjDA

