    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Vaglaskógur Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/vaglaskogur/ The camp site is sheltered and very good for tents, mobile homes and folding campers. There is electricity in the area called Stórarjóðri as well as Flatagerði. There is also a playground in those areas. In the service houses there are toilets, warm water and showers as well as toilets for the disabled. A waste disposal is also at Vaglaskógur. A small grocery store is at the camp site selling with common necessities. The forest Vaglaskógur is one of the most beautiful forests in Iceland with many walking paths and a lot of opportunity for outdoor activity. Open 1 June - 1 September Phone: +354 860 4714 Price: Kr. 1700/adult (Free for 14 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Shower (Kr. 500) - Electricity (Kr. 1100) - Hiking paths - Golf course - Playground
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGS26ac8fHcDT8VlBF-jlLuZI3H4hm2_dXBowczZEo8cUp769mZ0uWGs8SEDBzfCIITK7E-suOzd6-1PH8SdX7c19oWQr3-d7tyksSqyoYfGYx3zvCFfXgJpNSLxoDIASGYNjFiTv9zii4dbJhJJEDW9lYC1kwKNsdvjWcQZfwYsPm6H3ijQ0avq709DVRLc1DKFKWdUcanTnH-r136KbCG-i5oByD6T1oSNRnNOHz6YZpXOikkWsefFz-E?authuser=0&fife=s16383
