    <Placemark>
      <name>Kidagil Campsite/Guesthouse</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/mDKkMa1vnzxhREmV8 In the middle of the valley Bárðardalur, about 23 km from highway no 1 is the camp site located. If you are arriving from the highland it is about 20 km after descending from Sprengisandur. There are many beautiful waterfalls close by such as Goðafoss, Aldeyjarfoss and Hrafnabjargarfossar. The camp site is in a peaceful and quiet spot. There are toiletfacilites and showers as well as access to electricity. There is also a playground and a football field. Open 1 June - 10 September Phone: +354 464 3290 Price: 1500 ISK/adult Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (800 ISK) - Washer/dryer (700 ISK / each) - Playground
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRRtnbsX4Z7uahPIq_ZoVyTmTS9iSL41uvInl5yW2e9ynf8fH58ItrovpPC4_-CFfxF2UapnTFFrz9rV7ePOkSO_KZX2pvXJkogxM5UEmsMa_99i4wpp1fvGQu2PYYfio6u7fTkwI_A7dhv8rHQ17wV9ohp8Tr-wwmjCHnjrngB1gzzEwq3CJORkUszhDt2PmK8Q-DCCQsCSDoizcjuUJfT8xzLRkQAOeNqlxN9W9xmEhFmXbGD8jBzsls?authuser=0&fife=s16383
