    <Placemark>
      <name>Fossholl Guesthouse/Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/y11EJioiBTs7C1EE8 https://www.youtube.com/embed/97k1cKhXmzo This campsite is located by the Fosshóll Guesthouse, near the famous Godafoss waterfall. The location is beautiful and the restaurant is excellent but the facilities are lacking a bit. The campsite includes showers, nice toilets, and hot water, but no kitchen facilities. The toilets are not separated by gender, it’s just one storage container type building. It also has picnic tables. Location is perfect for Godafoss and was not crowded at all. (Thanks to Jessica G. for the information) Phone: +354 464 3108 Price: ISK 1500/person Facilities: - WC - Water - Restaurant - Store access - Showers
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQvYT6Ulv-neVP6I2k7sQxRffwqYlp_UKxoZyIeXkT7bO6wGp0jEm5r-aSNgOvMGXm-NWpzVecDGkE-Tpbno86OPqaHdgAcenK2ZpXA4YI6LQEmTmVmdE4Br3iB7SlWazrjEvdw2rOYcfSJ5i7tx1LR7eovvkJuCZG5m0X7K07fw1RbhRrXrED_451Jj3QY5D-y-jyZAETrlyLJLj4WvU1weEi2Sev21QlduN2NXM2bBrrXPetYleJ4M08?authuser=0&fife=s16383
