    <Placemark>
      <name>Dalakofinn Campsite/Restaurant</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/26EjFtm8wPZJvqA7A This campsite is located by the family-owned restaurant and shop Dalakofinn. Since the summer of 2013 they have been running a camping area next to the local sports field. The swimming pool in Laugar and a new 6 hole golf course are in walking distances from the camping area. It is fair to say that the camping area is very well located, and all equipment is top of the line. The camping area has free wireless internet. In the field house are most of the service points of the camping area. There you'll find toilets, showers free of use for visitors, washing machine and tumble dryer. On the top floor you will find chairs and tables, as well as cooking facilities with a fridge. Apart from the washing machine and tumble dryer, the facilities are free to use for our guests. Open 15 May - 15 September Phone: +354 464 3344 Price: Kr. 1800/adult (Free for 14 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Shower - Water - Electricity (Kr. 700) - Washer/dryer (Kr. 700/700) - Playground - Store access - Restaurant
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTD4cpZ3quhxdi6uN4Iw65OaDB4_i79yWeaeS82YrJxzJQ8UBWdNsjMsJK2YYv3nZVK99O_wS-YXlL6uQuMR7DduKZ52icQQ8RUdfJz3I_ZYlJAv30CNc_OQ4aCfdL0CFi4NPT-algHFdDUWYNa-3jK8YTICRbhZKVStX2R8-fohoYNV9Esk0swli3j0nZZCacgkN-vo3rzM-ZjMKbuF_r5jdc2iSPCGDjnTkEERwX1DLr-eae6FsYO2yk?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://goo.gl/maps/26EjFtm8wPZJvqA7A

