    <Placemark>
      <name>Húsavík Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/husavik/ A good camp site in Húsavík, a walking distance to the swimming pool and grocery store. There is cooking facilities, two showers, washing machine and toilets. there is also free internet connection. Open 15 May-30 September Phone: +354 464 4300 Price: Kr. 1600/adutl (Free for 18 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Washing machine (Kr. 800) - Restaurant - Hiking paths - Cooking facilities - Golf course - WiFi - Pool/hot tub - Store access
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRi4U4lAToIfNLlFQY6CrhhS4UFcZVNo5HyWIPYtCJmUvtXbI7NfWe4XdchSH3XxpQU_8kSx_rrq8eZk0BujrHrg7wId4HeWWrlMSdnSA8DXMDef-mKehl7bn4kpgG0JwdCtZiPMfxSGemieEiCySFJkTn6rN5V-Gqcpnjy5Rw5UTUCvIbESD6Op8pAjqq9OMYpw9-IiFUxKcu-R7-HFjJMu4CGgcmGlkDmo_oloKH_rjJS2JK-8aRNXto?authuser=0&fife=s16383
