    <Placemark>
      <name>Kopasker Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/kopasker/ The camp site at Kópasker is just by the entrance into the village. The service house has two sinks, shower and a toilet and is very visible from the road. The camp site is below and is sheltered from wind from all directions except the south. The camp site has a coal barbeque, electricity and an area to hang clothes out to dry. There are also picnic tables. In the village Kópasker there is a health care, a pharmacy, a bank, a store, a wine store and a mecanic. You will also find a museum just outside the village. Also a 9 hole golf course, playground and much more. Many nice walking paths are nearby and visible on a map on the camp site. When the weather is good there are seals lying on the shore and you will also find alot of bird life in and around the village. Phone: +354 864 2157 Price: Kr. 1600/adult (Free for 16 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 800) - Shower - Cooking facilities - Washing machine
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQemKsoShUC8IcrDgKFOAcDeYz3AEoddjkgFDoPe9H-XG-Hrdf6c0gpZTzFzOHgWNapxzKQjIzr5AL5lCpPnscToQjq74nchJmuuWmf9YqSVHbYoDyCAdWpmIypr4GaKkXoVu5AZ2inhtnYOd_6yjPzmjjWbCcQkYHneAkDNj4yC4WEOv93jZfguFJSHVPX3BeOpz0K2vIs7mbULmP25JKzT71LTwm7PaDHo0w26ac78LDCKLKRmbZEKYk?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/kopasker/

