    <Placemark>
      <name>Raufarhöfn Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/raufarhofn/ The campsite in Raufarhöfn is located by the school and sports center. It has a simple service house with running water and a shower. You pay for admission in the local pool, which is close by. You will find BBQ grills, electricity, and nice picnic tables. Open 1 June - 15 September Phone: +354 468 1515 / +354 468 1220 Price: Kr. 1200/adult (Free for 15 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Washer/dryer (Kr. 800) - Cooking facilities - Shower - Pool/hot tub - Store access
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSez8l3lv5seIPqwj97EjUgtw9nMTgRjpNHRU7NY737MrBNNa65WZUuqHgXdNjDOG5B3uR4pHdM6Lp5WHpbVTigIbaKIcJ4fN6XZvDUOmTsUvTwjFbdGrFNAv7AgQfUvZeHDawjf67wYq0Mn5xu4ZVOs9Tyw6cSkJTHMuG8KsNG50e3m3hjfynv75a516uFsPilyg6sXJprVdXlezz-hIUMsBxbNaUlzjXtCNZ-8lZ67MfwkPEgu-e51rs?authuser=0&fife=s16383
