    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Þórshöfn Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/T3jookFwVTG8qXNZA Fisheries have been the primary sector in terms of work and development of the town. Therefore, it is quite interesting to take a walk down to the harbor and watch the life of a typical fishing town. The sports hall in Þórshöfn offers a good indoor swimming pool, hot pots and a gym. The hall also hosts a tourist information center and a laundromat. Open Open 1 June - 1 September Phone: +354 468 1220 Price: Kr. 1400/adult (Free for 14 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity Kr. 900 - Waste disposal - Shower - Restaurant - Hiking paths - Cooking facilities - Playground - WiFi - Playground - Washer/dryer - Pool/hot tub - Fishing - Dogs allowed - Store access
