    <Placemark>
      <name>Ásbrandsstadir Cottage/Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/asbrandsstadir/ Ásbrandsstaðir is near the sea, on the north side of Hofsárdal, about 7 km. from the village of Vopnafjörður along road nr. 917 toward the airport, then right on road nr. 920. The campsite is split into 2 sections. One is a flat piece of grass and the other has gravel, which is made for camper vans. You will find a service hose there with two bathrooms and a shower. Phone: +354 473 1459 Price: Kr. 1500/adult - Kr. 700/child (11-18) Facilities: - WC - Water - Shower - Electricity (Kr.500) - Washer/dryer (donation) - Cooking facilities - Hiking paths - Playground - WiFi - Pool/hot tub - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSqZcU72uT9tntbI-a54QDWE3DuGd38rvhpoSfDK6_JGaXP9yYLzR1Mf9-XAKXH5aInFU27Emrv99y8hMH18Ti2jGT-lq1e1oXosFTkC2hOMwspOiZMPe_cUPHaI5_mhM4D7750vWNrc-gEpZEQ1UaEKnqcmvjj0Jqtd9_DiyYZYmGa1idbfwsNTOB0ZF-S2sAxt8NWRaIdGA3pZK_8lYsxqMnpDF-3_GxhK9F-A9mDfXXTGSreWZCGUN0?authuser=0&fife=s16383
