    <Placemark>
      <name>Reykjahlíð (Bjarg) Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/DiAqaPKGsN4qSnzV8 Situated in a beautiful peaceful surrounding right on the North-East shore of Lake Mývatn, just across the Tourist Info & Supermarket. Service provided: camping, accommodation, hot showers, cooking facilities, laundry service, bike rental and souvenir shop. You can get a DISCOUNT up to 1000 ISK for camping or accommodation here, if you buy excursions (Askja, Ice Cave, Whale Watching, Horse riding etc.) and scheduled bus tickets (Dettifoss, Landmannalaugar, Höfn etc.) in Bjarg Reception. Phone: +354 464 4390 Price: 2000 ISK/adults Facilities: - WC - Water - Shower - Cooking facilities - Hiking paths - Store access - Washer/dryer - Bike rental - Boat rental - Pool/hot tub
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSnv2vgCIUlDLZjsd3hvHPyMBJAIavTuYB1_UrOqvULr7CHqOmVVCpyRA7dTXcfF_DeBrP-UkiQ1nY-PgOZGhmJYrgkWtiUsOLeKaKkBcTKXM8U_-4yqZTx377MrBdkVwrI2Jg3Cc2PoBjeTw6648sDu93mvNOriTfhny0h7h-lFX9ot7ios5Qr9Hs0KMWx3sRZq2ARjMuDQoF1wqxdMzhhXt6t0OFkst2LVTYygoYUbCgaDpFo_lJED3U?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://goo.gl/maps/DiAqaPKGsN4qSnzV8

Commentaire: Style: icon:1765,color:000000 | gx_media_links: https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSnv2vgCIUlDLZjsd3hvHPyMBJAIavTuYB1_UrOqvULr7CHqOmVVCpyRA7dTXcfF_DeBrP-UkiQ1nY-PgOZGhmJYrgkWtiUsOLeKaKkBcTKXM8U_-4yqZTx377MrBdkVwrI2Jg3Cc2PoBjeTw6648sDu93mvNOriTfhny0h7h-lFX9ot7ios5Qr9Hs0KMWx3sRZq2ARjMuDQoF1wqxdMzhhXt6t0OFkst2LVTYygoYUbCgaDpFo_lJED3U?authuser=0&fife=s16383

