    <Placemark>
      <name>Stóra Sandfell Guesthouse/Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/3FyzBYma5iSDHrb98 The Stóra-Sandfell Travel Service is located 17 km. south of Egilsstaðir on highway no. 1 which is the main road between Egilsstaðir and Höfn. We offer our guests a nice camping place and accommodation in cottages or separated rooms. We also offer horse tours in our beautiful surroundings which are also ideal for nice hiking trails. The campsite is in a forest that has many nice camping places. The campsite also has good restroom, six toilets, sinks, showers and hot and cold water. There are available outdoor barbecues that visitors are welcome to use, and lot of tables and benches. The camping ground and horse rental are open from June 1st - September 1st. Phone: +354 471 2420 Price: Kr. 1500/adult - Kr. 1000/teenager (Free for 12 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Showers - Cooking facilities - Hiking paths - Horse rental
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSxVTFGv_lga-HsFMqU8wZagcj_eMrr-z2t86Lmb65c9T-_j6SLIDLE9AtEXS818bx0n829Yy3u2PZKzy1wBQCGs4hWGDAp-s39emktUAiRMT21dDTUA8_DD89ZsTmWK1_oC3CvgUXEmoVbwuDZjZiINW-tLeX3u6SRI2g5iXqWfeRy6tHTs-ePR4wZHc3cyn1mp6yY_e-f8ImB3c_h5bUeXTdSfjTox1q6SyB4-yKw3yw84Buu5615EUA?authuser=0&fife=s16383
