    <Placemark>
      <name>Sólbrekka Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/solbrekka/ The campsite has two toilets, shower, outdoor bench + table, 3G connection, washing machine and a tumble dryer. The house is open 24 hours. Possible to connect mobile homes to electricity. Playground for the children. The area has many walking paths close by and you can get coffee and refreshments in Sólbrekka. Open 1 June to 15 September Phone: +354 894 9014 Price: Kr. 1500/adult (Free for 13 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Shower - Playground - WiFi - Hiking paths - Pool/hot tub - Washer/dryer (Kr. 500/500) - Dogs allowed - Electricity (1000 ISK)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQOcC9vJAnN-Rl7Ht35_RdWLFV603_0dV-uuMn40P0psMYj54KY1vvLsu9jgRqVfSpRMIXrpl_LLKwtxuMkp5FAzWz3uqbAes9Xnw8JpmQvppgqOB3_WtxW_45XZFNejCBTJam1wzZbFQ5Y28Hs0k5jwZSaA8uQPzrs8-sD9gkVmNxUReOmBDQI35ObDX0gt5JGzD9YAIKTpT7LOYM8kWmk00P5yVMrXmds1Oqsf4cdt6n4UzbWCOq7rxA?authuser=0&fife=s16383
