    <Placemark>
      <name>Neskaupstaður Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/puQtJNUqdZ6M3qk18 The camp site has good facilities with toilets, showers, electricity for mobile homes and a playground for the children. The camp site has an excellent view over the fjord next to the village. Open 1 June - 1 September Phone: +354 470 9000 Price: Kr. 1500/adult (Free for 18 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Playground - Golf course - Pool/hot tub - Shower - Hiking paths
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGT6Ndxfp8ixZhOcyJwWXLrMmSTlAns3IkZczmTp6lYr641zwmcRziPxfA-q6exT4lRFFj9OQdeMlC6m9C2zXH7fqMO6Rbno9Pve08RHDYODEN-UMGhWx45kPGg-u5ubriCcvBb3M_Otmenj2KMn8trcf58FePwGoa9ykL8IQubdle7YS8xffAd37BtNWBniE1uySoQAikIz7dIujMVFCiMvOLaMRvpiPKG4y-nMr39vjnSRzDwJgSHW3FU?authuser=0&fife=s16383
