      <styleUrl>#style_Campsites___Mountain_Huts</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-13.861424,64.832538,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Eyjolfsstadir Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/DpzCwNedJuVr4aZNA The camp site is in a sheltered area surrounded by mountains. It is spacious and possible to accomodate large groups. It is possible to accomodate both large number of small tents as well as large mobile homes. A small creek is by the camp site that the children love to play around in. The camp site is ideal for those who want peace and quiet in beautiful nature. The area has diverse walking paths and beautiful waterfalls in the river Fossá. Toilet facilities are in the service house as well as hot and cold water. It is also possible to connect to electricity altough the number of connections are limited. Phone: +354 820 4379 / +354 478 8971 Price: Kr. 1750/adult (including shower) Facilities: - WC - Shower - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Hiking paths - Water
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQ4WXJQ_MJ1xBcp9aYx1aQtJo9iz5bmZSIwBW9x2Z1yH69bsPncTBu_6H_-gTo9fpduD8_Lm-ulLlbK7ZgiqVE8y4KcEnRcxC1LTliOjKQHXIE8Cs2QrBtwxb728mFmLj7Mow5E5V_3LC0e1FHmsqYvqq2fOQcdBfPXZ4rlBrgJQ8DhL2vJEsqP-l9Jg9dgWpqcql3qmeL0OerUrb5f2IpIKCYTiHRmXNGUVWFjwH5thjyOD3xEJlLXieA?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://goo.gl/maps/DpzCwNedJuVr4aZNA

