    <Placemark>
      <name>Hörgsland Cottages/Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/horgsland/ The camp site is a short distance from Kirkjubæjarklaustur. There is also offered accommodation in summerhouses and room. The summerhouses have two bedrooms and area to sleep in the attic. There is also a small store and a restaurant where it is possible to order breakfast and dinner but guests need to order in advance. There is also a large assembly room that groups can use. There is a good playground for the children and many walking paths close by. The town Kirkjubæjarklaustur is only about 5 minutes away. Open 1 June - 15 September Phone: +354 487 6655 Price: Kr. 1600/adult Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Restaurant - Playground - WiFi - Golf course - Hiking trails - Fishing - Shower - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQDUOdJRzuxjTfq0vxN49BLsG-zdEh3hdwnoSexANYo45cyCj4ojeyTh2lH4Su0oqjQYbZC2VloF-NH0UlmRwMYufcczfOZn-B0TE8Tr5U_cwjavi_upLpBrSj7qTukMaPRGLBMcKj-FHtH7dlLNOM8Tx1nD789DkhEveNlAQIRU5TPXiFHDcB-foeUUClXw7r0CPkzsv0-4xxT8Rz7IeUXppAXe8wnCa3-J6pOL493I8gwmjfuZxyeQW8?authuser=0&fife=s16383
