      <name>Vestmannaeyjar (Þórsvöllur) Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/thorsvollur/ The camp site has a service house with cooking facilities, washing facilities and toilets. There is electricity and water for mobile homes and folding campers. There is an outdoor barbeque available for guests. There is also a playground for children. The camp site is a short walk from many services - 250 meters to the swimming pool and the sports area - 350 meters to the grocery store - 150 meters to the golf course Phone: +354 846 9111 Price: Kr. 1700/adult (Free for 12 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Cooking facilities - Electricity (Kr. 950) - Waste disposal - Hiking paths - Washer/dryer - Shower
