    <Placemark>
      <name>Þykkvibær Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/thykkvibaer/ Þykkvibær is the oldest country village in Iceland. The camp site in Þykkvibær is located in the middle of the village Þykkvibær. The camp site is located between the elementary school and the sports hall. Th Phone: +354 895 7680 Price: 1000 ISK /adult Facilities: - WC - Water (cold) - Electricity - Waste disposal - Playground - Pool/hot tub - Horse rental - Hiking trails
