    <Placemark>
      <name>Leirubakki Hotel/Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/wevbVpAHvGji4jti6 TEMPORARILY CLOSED. The camp site at Leirubakki has good facilities. There is a playground for children. Next to the camp site the Hekla Center is located with information about the volcano Hekla and also with a restaurant. In the lava next to the camp site is a hot pool, a viking pool, that is lit up during the evening. A part of the camp site is meant for folding campers and mobile homes and that part has electricity. Leirubakki also has a gas station with a small retail store where you can buy soda, disposable barbeque and other things you might need in a camping trip. Leirubakki also has a horse rental for both shorter and longer riding tours. Phone: +354 487 8700 Price: Kr. 1100/adult (Free for 12 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Restaurant - Playground - Electricity - Hiking paths - Horse rental - Pool/hot tub
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSvX8W7XP79jSLWD9V4eBpOeWCD7hNCwAs_tglZPhQ4FVGf5HGB3JnyoVSLBGj6AK1qgHNfm9b-WtUN8qId1tXumIeCElTlrcKsKBIc9bxLwN7gQj4aVzFQ9anoj4b0141F2qtlJiIVirGL-STW9CR5q3kiUsLLdBxQTZwhpbZN6VmqJZWejfp2t8PT15vDfGp6gDbx0E1U_9rw60GBGTUsf5iBM3FErlNIUGEoebmyyM3gO4s6GyCiZ2o?authuser=0&fife=s16383
