    <Placemark>
      <name>Sandártunga (Þjórsárdalur) Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/thjorsardalur/ The camp site in Thjorsardalur is well located in a small forest. The area provides good shelter and the camp site is in different small areas in between the trees. Open 1 June - 1 September Phone: +354 893 8889 Price: Kr. 1500/adult (free for 12 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water (cold) - Hiking paths - Playground - Dogs allowed
