    <Placemark>
      <name>Árnes Campsite/Hostel</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/arnes/ The campsite is in beautiful surroundings close to the river Kálfá. The campsite is a spacious flat area with about 36 electricity plugs and there are also some side areas. Also there is a good area suitable for smaller groups next to the swimming pool. The area has a football field, a hostel and a retail store. Visitor centre, Þjórsárver, is a multimedia show about the river Þjórsá and the area. There is also a restaurant there, which focuses on traditional Icelandic food. Phone: +354 486 6048 Price: Kr. 1500/adult (Free for 11 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Shower - Electricity (Kr. 900) - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTb25BpIJo4UO8UrR9lEttN1LyqU9fPLZwdXHk43fd-vf7pYLOnH8oZVyHwjNi3MRMD4_WvlWWm5wzgakhBSBKFOXWAVLhL2aToHElNFmZxHHLt87-US99156JzW7-sVWP_0ppndO0VS_CHiyZ0Eq6_a1oNBGUlBht9SBtHLKqlb30KtX8dboa1rFC6eHj0t9choHAZmI1bJ2rIhnnHfs5vOhfGFibC0C6skehiX-gI6du_f8agnIwBGoI?authuser=0&fife=s16383
