    <Placemark>
      <name>Faxi Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/vid-faxa/ The camp site is in a quiet and beautiful surroundings and it is a short distance to all services from the camp sie. There is a beautiful view from the camp site and many beautiful walking paths. A restaurant / coffee house has recently opened at the camp site Open 15 May - 15 September Phone: +354 774 7440 Price: Kr. 1300 / adults; Kr. 500/7-15yo Facilities: - WC - Water (cold) - Cooking facilities - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Hiking paths - Pool/hot tub - Waste disposal - Restaurant - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSk00Nwh1k8Prhxi7yfjf5jUZMuX23cvnwE_Hy66xxvtQuZjwUJoog4fEgEL3r0ypbh2W3PUff6lfGJ_T-dfN19EKS24fwUc3Er0S9gBHyoTERHn-aTIzUJDfw_HhzYEqbLzB6kJsXy9vSAufzZ7oN6WB6F2CsBMNEiMdzjKg2hQ63hc5C1xwDI8z5_HTXrqg718s16akQ6nw0w0jse-kB4X3ml9PMovS7SoSHDFhuva3pavsuYQIWh7dw?authuser=0&fife=s16383
