    <Placemark>
      <name>Borg Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/YCYUxg39HzV28VKg9 The camp site has four restrooms, shower, good facilities to do the dishes, electricity and toilet for the diabled. There is also a waste disposal for mobile homes.The swimming pool at the sport center in Borg is only a short distance away as well as a playground. Open 15 May - 15 September Phone: +354 767 3411 Price: Kr. Kr 2000/camper Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Dogs allowed - Golf course - Pool/hot tub - Shower
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGR9-wd9Dkm-y52oadpMbFdj6Q1K9yKarL4Rbe_kCuavj0DL4a8_L5tH75anUAE-GSlE2jrWgXERftVrcTw95DxwZUZD1TFduE9eAAPptdKuJmnZS7tRkAKxHRdnxKJUhAiPHQDDLw7BqA07bVIDYb1kDw1RGVcoM8E-0jcnIddxl2_JizXyv6hCIkvhK5qTdI5lOTm2rxItgcu3qz9ZPvAZ0OmLf_Cm3w_Zu1ZrJfNFy5BQ1di614P3pUM?authuser=0&fife=s16383
