    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Þorlákshöfn Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/thorlakshofn/ The approach to the camp site is from Skálholtsbraut. The camp site is located next to the sports center and the church. The camp site has a service house with three toilets and facilities to wash the dishes. Next to the swimming pool is a football field, playground and the sports area. The area has okey facilities for the disabled with the area being flat and there is also a toilet for the disabled. Open 15 May - 15 September Phone: +354 480 3890 Price: Kr. 1500/adult (Free for 15 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Hiking paths - Electricity (Kr. 1100) - Golf course - Playground - Pool/hot tub - Fishing - Waste disposal - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQmBoa2P8n8PRtU2cWW7w3cxmmHv1QW0natg_WUExCMGkHHgdPyIMEI6CmdbbNXVdSxYp1qGZ1b83eHQ3rMbZWIfPRbuy6y63KyGqN336wFPCFW0fdl3PcffkUuIXzQ-rF_HpvClnVNkRwGb7dT-BZxHzjXC9Rlcuggz_w_oVStTy6DYOjnsBuUzCprc-Vq_29j0M-GruxLq56rrBrjix6fO_xaJXIdN1_LMf95kaCvq6RIjNrahnwNMys?authuser=0&fife=s16383
