    <Placemark>
      <name>Thingvellir Campsite (Vantskot)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/vwZ4ZfRx4uACypLZ8 The Vatnskot camp ground is situated at an abandoned farm site by the lake. Camping and angling permits should be obtained at the Information Centre on arrival. Children under the age of 13 can stay overnight, free of charge. Groups (10 adults or more) get a 15% discount if they pay in one sum at the time of reservation. You will find much more facilities at the main campsite by the information center, although Vatnskot has its benefits, such as nice views and possibly more privacy. The camping grounds are mowed each week and the toilet facilities are cleaned at least once a day. Garbage does not have to be sorted before being put into the disposal cans, except that special containers for aluminium soda cans, glass bottles and plastic bottles are provided. Charcoal and ash from the barbecues should also be disposed of into separate containers. During the summer Park Rangers look after the camping areas every day and during the weekends they keep nightshifts, to make sure everything is quiet after midnight Phone: +354 482 2660 Open: 1 June - 1 September Adults (18-66 years) ISK 1300 /night. Senior (67 +) and disabled ISK. 650 / night. Children/teens 0-17 years free of charge. A 15% discount is offered for groups over 10 persons if payed together. Electricity for RV´s and campervan 900 ISK at night. At the campground it is possible to use washing machine and dryer at the price of 800 ISK. There is no reservation needed for camping in any campsite at Thingvellir national park. Camping and angling permits should be obtained at the Information Centre on arrival.
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGR1f3sz9tBcHiN3AXY7QZ0s4lR_7UyfteWDJPVGcqzFnTtSBba_OcPes0hEQtdoQla2Yh4ppm1zSgarPbOPcD-k4HULawv0p1-PzBXtjNj2AVHRWvp_noMjaNjUar99KOLqErvmrH8tW_Hy75xzORT_lU13E2b6JDiJgxqofte433bZ862ZzwOt5K68WV_X5qZ6J-_Y0ONlRxljMwMQFbrOSiGJyAo2YeW2OcEnfFemU780_QhMICkx07A?authuser=0&fife=s16383
