    <Placemark>
      <name>Systragil Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/systragil/ The camp site Systragil is in the valley Fnjóskadalur, about 36 km for Akureyri. When driving there you turn off highway no 1 onto road 833 and drive on for about 5 km. A short distance is in a swimming pool at the school Stórutjarnarskóli and to Illugastaðir. There is also fishing in the river Fnjóská. A small grocery store is a short walk away and also a 9 hole golf course. Walking pats are around the forest and the camp site. Alot of growth is in the area and the small creek Systralækur runs through the camp site. Above the camp site there grows a lot of berries and mushrooms. The camp site Systragil is sheltered with growth and is suitable for tents, folding campers and mobile homes. There is electricity, a playground, heated toilets, washing machine, how running water, showers and waste disposal. Dogs are allowed. The camp site is in two ledges. There is electricity in all the ledges and a playground by the service house. Open: June 1st - September 30 Phone: +354 860 2213 Price: Kr. 1500/adult (Free for 15 and younger. Kr. 1100/senior) Facilities: - WC - Shower (Kr. 300/5min) - Water - Washing machine (Kr. 500) - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Pool/hot tub - Golf course - Hiking paths - Fishing - Waste disposal - Playground - Dogs allowed
