    <Placemark>
      <name>Langaholt Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/SscgUwZC5YCN3sEb6 This simple campsite is located by a guesthouse on the south of Snæfellsnes peninsula. The campsite is far from the road and the traffic noise but close to the beach. There is cold, drinkable water on the site and warm showers are available for a small fee. If you contact them directly, they will let travelers spend the night during the wintertime. Please be careful of the beach, as cars can get easily stuck there. Phone: +354 435 6789 Price: Kr. 1000/adult Facilities: - WC - Water
