    <Placemark>
      <name>Breiðdalsvík Campground</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/breiddalsvik/ The camp site is located behind Hotel Bláfell. There is hot and cold running water, toilet facilities and electricity. Good facilities in a great location with all the highlights nearby. Close to swimming pool, restaurants, shops, cafes, craft market, museums and more. Great environment for families. Services in the vicinity of the camp site include a sports hall with a swimming pool, playground, outdoor recreation area, restaurant, car park, research center, bank, post office, shop and petrol station. Opening 1 June to 1 September Accommodation: Individual ISK 1500. pr. person Electricity ISK 1,000 per day Free for children 15 years and younger
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSjdCacwfXs1yUrdxq-MmMh81C9SkOQyFrwidvaeCnU2mjikS3H8I8lCZCkLIBRVDLtYIuM68awftS_8y58VLA-qAMldwNgSLaT9SYBeUw4Mqa62HHoz3_p6VTPkfiUA4sBuPyxMuuYmH642FCk7QC5YxZW_61TBpukSCm_ODxJJb3bN0wkIp6XtueJmeuyYtlF3AXF2zCR-zrj0vAzKbj4Qa9JsOcYGE4asfELCJKL4CUn48G9YXFIRQ8?authuser=0&fife=s16383
