    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Happy Campsite Keflavik</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/happycampsite/ The Happy Campsite is located only 6 min from the KEF Airport and has all the necessary facilities for a comfortable stay. Brand new facilities with toilets and showers have hot and cold water. There are also washbasins outside with cold running water and free Wi-Fi. Happy Campsite Keflavik is located in Reykjanes peninsula, which is full of hidden gems - spectacular nature, Reykjanes UNESCO Global Geopark, the hot springs at Seltun, Blue Lagoon, Fagradalsfjall volcano, and so much more. - Phone: 578-7860 - Open: 13 April - 30 September - Price: ISK 1,500/adult. Children (0-16 years) Free. - WC - Electricity - Shower - Store access (in town)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQAQ7zl8BDpeAvJvzL_kJfmGclDHE1Z8A2AJXM0v2khpD7s4BgKd6085N5A9jtSqHGEsNtSiAgs_Pgdx9xGFKY-EbhaMzWV7FSKpWLG-AlHnuB4JkReRDIRHwzEy6x9siIGrUFsXJ1BpryetfV0ygYh0ZnD0V2nlvUpvSAK8lImo_zSUsGHch1Xp_8QHSb6jwdQmjuLas5PGdtGNG0vyi4A4_TbkEOFkWq0yo5z9kPvVPcQ_OCi8BWLZCg?authuser=0&fife=s16383
