    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Grindavík</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://grindavikcampsite.com This campsite opened in 2009 and has great facilities. It's family friendly and was actually designed for the camping enthusiast in mind. It has 2 playgrounds for kids, family BBQ area, warm and cozy common area, large private showers, washer and dryer, and lots more. It's located in a convenient location, so the grocery store is only about a 10 min. walk from the campsite. - Phone: 6607323 - Open: March 1st - November 30th - Price: Kr. 2000 for 1 person, (Free for kids 14 years or younger) - WC - Showers (included) - Cooking facilities - Electricity - Water - Washer/Dryer (Kr. 700 each) - Garbage disposal - Hiking trails - Playground - Store access - Wifi
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRuIZbn8RxmUMF-YM3B14R_CswcX7FvchKg2a5R2kHfbq4OX4lW6XLJKh2AvcycpMYviMhMBp3q13qk14xYLWZ8WA8YtlRfDrCMLszndCHw3BuHeaTQ4I5VK_yWpJ6MPbNDtSTJ7QBuMe-ed4pknVOP4d4UJl4Mj7PvMvFOHQyZEyN_EHTwWjwuU71SDc7hi_pFbK7sPZ9E4FNCjfjfqOPKYKrtzfT_ubYGF-OKaA1ofPmsJ_qniYlpz4E?authuser=0&fife=s16383
