    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Artun Campsite/Guesthouse</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://artun.is/eng/tjaldstaedid.html Ártún is in the rural district of Grýtubakkahreppur by road no 83. It is between the church place Laufás and the village Grenivík. Good facilities and enough space for tents, folding campers, caravans and mobile houses. Good toilet facilities. Toilets with showers, indoor facilities to dine, electricity, waste disposal and possible to get wireless internet connection. Possible to buy wine and beer at Ártún. The camp site is kept well maintained and are in a flatland. The space is almost infinite which offers those who want the possibility to be alone. The underlay is different if you are in a mobile home or a tent. The area around Ártún is ideal for walking and hiking. The mountain Kaldbakur is 1.167 meters high and has good walking paths to the top. For those who want an easier mountain than the mountain Þengilhöfði is about 260 meters high. It is also popular to walk on the mountain Laufáshnjúkur that is about 662 meters high. It is a fairly easy walk altough the last part is a bit steep. From the top of Laufáshnjúk is a great view over the fjord Eyjafjörður. There is a lot to see close by The old town of Laufás, museum(2 km.) The fisherymuseum in Grenivík(8 km.) At Grýtubakki(4 km.) is a horse rental Kaldbakstours offer trips to Kaldbak during the winter in a snowcat. Possible to fish in the rivers Fnjóská and Fjarðará The campsite is open between may 1st and september 30th. Off-season stay at the campsite is possible upon request, pending weather and other conditions. Phone: +354 892 3591 Price: Kr. 1300/adult (Free for 16 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Shower - Water (cold) - Waste disposal - Hiking paths - Cooking facilities - WiFi - Electricity (Kr. 1000)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGR6vgbMPxkAkmt6cHgj09pd5yos15TdxYS2QGFhcp5fdVuAss20pDFBuLa_4M0w2JVIoxDpsYoemtC0H_7Sl-H8HTNC3HM0AFw0Y34eGK_39QJQYqCaNDaOAik_Ax-V6tHhZTOIFMaHXyu1GXajQpnntLcFGZNZCKk-N10kt-86hKzVFoTPIXgruXintIykvOgAZX7i-gkvhK2jZAPWH5aFVwAbzj9noEayuHSoB1bhLb-f0HDrcYj3XmI?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://artun.is/eng/tjaldstaedid.html

