    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Reykholt Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/reykholt/ The camp site is in the village Reykholt. The camp site is divided into several beautiful groves and one large one. The camp site is a short distance from Gullfoss, waterfall, Geysir, Flúðir and Laugarvatn. It is only about 15 minutes drive to the village Laugarás where the zoo Slakki is. The age limit is 25 years unless travelling with families. In the village and close by you will find a small store, the restaurant Café Mika, Friðheimar with its famous tomato soup and a swimming pool in a walking distance. Open 1 April - 15 October Phone: +354 847 5057 Price: Kr. 1500/adult - Kr. 500/12-16 yr. - Free for 12 and younger Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1200) - Hiking paths - Pool/hot tub - Waste disposal - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQbrTvXWGB-sPRQLVx90HRq1IrQwWaPDXBGgK_LyLKSmuSn-HenMQdvUcP-d5gpHhiNlVIaj_RsxFjXZXWgHnK0sGr1L1wfGi9WSMzdg_LN67g43yiDuL59BqQhoXfoPqGG78rbko2a4nZETOub_yiJuVdueErLHxoTdnOCAh93YPC4ea40g1oopANZ6dH8g8A5D7hiKfAjipCTEShZR5D0EkfJztdqGuyPqYhWLXwFjudr-9HszC-b52s?authuser=0&fife=s16383
