    <Placemark>
      <name>Mosskogar Camping</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/mosskogar/ Mosskógar is a lovely organic farm just 15 mín drive from the center of Reykjavík. They run a camping site, and a farmers market every Saturday from the beginning of July tó the end of September. The farm is just off road no 1 on the road to our National Park, Thingvellir and the Golden circle. It has some nice facilities, an outside picnic area and many hiking paths in the surrounding area. Open: March 1st - December 15th Phone: +354 663 6173 Price: Kr.2000/adult (Free for 13 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Cooking facilities - Shower - WiFi (Free) - Washing machine (Kr. 500) - Horse rental nearby - Dogs allowed More info: https://www.facebook.com/mosskogar.johannsson (https://www.facebook.com/mosskogar.johannsson )
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRxT2ad73zxmkudUveyKGOwlGHnb0RB8kY2wE5EvH1wjYoxXzwHKBj2sI_K5DmlrGarO3X1gL5r-f88kqKU3MRqnJHDcDtRSNMqWVyNIPR3G7O9jT_Bmeh11-16HjX6YvYZgvdUGJ__RuVbVH6TB1YBYRwkijAEBFSOVoqodfhSwGMt8nrEFGUXc0BQ06mwQnEiPWNSzBG20AZnkktLp5ctM434aeC_cWOmjG0k9yyg3P1PAlsfaHuCIRE?authuser=0&fife=s16383
