    <Placemark>
      <name>Laugarvatn Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/laugarvatn/ Spacious camp site in a beautiful Laugarvatn area, close to Fontana Geothermal Baths. All service is close by a store and restaurants. The age limit is 20 years and there should be quiet at the camp site after 24:00 so the guests can sleep in piece and quiet during the night. Open: 22. May - 31. October Phone: +354 771 4777 Price: Kr. 2500/adult - Kr. 1000/6-16 yr. - Free for 6 and younger Facilities: - WC - Electricity (Kr.1000) - Water - Hiking paths - Golf course - Shower - Pool/hot tub - Fishing - Horse rental - Waste disposal
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGS_JyqEBkNV-u8Y2F8Ekd9YbCw96B7Jg-4nTrvCMSmwPaRJ2ZyK6dnncaFg6a7G1H_GK1eXkLsJdBm9iReH-LyuGQf1vuYrupHyplyC6tsYuPFplyn-_D2cn6LFWxFcRHTPbkkE4Z6KyBjItQjv8RWXcQJ4TMjZz6xuDv30Yc3cZNZ2RtlQrSKostGfozFEGebLGJKyphBIl4Y69IauqYqKRFXpvdb4pBfYv_VOS2RemfW1VaFEDQWv8-0?authuser=0&fife=s16383
