      <styleUrl>#style_Campsites___Mountain_Huts</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-20.733454,64.221807,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Hvolsvöllur Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/hvolsvollur/ The camp site is located on the first exit to the right when entering the village from west (from Reykjavík). The camp site was first opened in 1980 and is sheltered by large trees. The area is divided into smaller parts that are sheltered by smaller trees. The areas are flat and covered with greass. The camp site is a well located camp site with two service houses. One has dishwashing facilities as well as simple cooking facilities. The other is a new house with toilets, showers, access for the disabled and exchange room for small children. It has also dishwashing facilities. There is waste disposal for mobile homes as well as water. The camp site has a playground for children. There is electricity and internet connection. All services are close by in the village. Open: May 15 - Nov 1 Phone: +354 898-2454 Price: Kr. 1750/adult (Free for kids 12 years and younger) 13-16 years old: Kr. 500 Seniors: Kr. 1250 Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Playground - Shower (Kr. 400) - Hiking paths - WiFi - Pool/hot tub - Waste disposal - Dogs allowed - Washing machine (free) - Dryer (free).
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTHOMdQX09Ji5CVg_AorZMG3PqqnIKHADBW61wvWN6OGExI-RGQ48DOyyzVAnTbuPcVdkE7BV6aaF2h0hWc__hWIaBj90Y8Jhc02L2QzwdujhdGQpMMfCW2yBK03Zr4MXKXIWwLWpoBO4hVlSOjfnXwIDoepHuPTUpUhn4P-LsAqKL5QW4t-SL-95cFIo8qJIWgRksPGRr4-s56LgKa-RU1EwpoLpzUab_4KlbA04RuKD-GHTGp2FEEQeQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/hvolsvollur/

Commentaire: Style: icon:1765,color:000000 | gx_media_links: https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTHOMdQX09Ji5CVg_AorZMG3PqqnIKHADBW61wvWN6OGExI-RGQ48DOyyzVAnTbuPcVdkE7BV6aaF2h0hWc__hWIaBj90Y8Jhc02L2QzwdujhdGQpMMfCW2yBK03Zr4MXKXIWwLWpoBO4hVlSOjfnXwIDoepHuPTUpUhn4P-LsAqKL5QW4t-SL-95cFIo8qJIWgRksPGRr4-s56LgKa-RU1EwpoLpzUab_4KlbA04RuKD-GHTGp2FEEQeQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383

