      <styleUrl>#style_Campsites___Mountain_Huts</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-22.067509,64.326068,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Kirkjubær II Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/kirkjubaer/ The camp site is large and plain with a lot of growth around. There is a cosy slope above the camp site with great view. The camp site is spacious and well equipped. Thera are also small cabins for rent with a sleeping bag accomodation. There is also an internet connection at the camp site with the first 15 minutes free. The service house has cooking facilities, dining area, hot and cold water, showers, washing machine, tumble dryer and heated toilets, also for disabled. The toilet for the disavled is spacious with a handle and it can easily fit a wheelchair and an assistant. There is also a shower for the disabled at that camp site. In the area around the village there are many walking paths, a swimming pool, a football field, a grocery store, health care and much more. All within a walking distance from the camp site. Open: 15. March - 15. November Phone: +354 894 4495 Price: Kr. 1,600/adult (Free for 12 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Cooking facilities - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Hiking paths - Showers (Kr. 300) - Pool/hot tub (400 m away from campsite) - Restaurant (150 m away from the campsite) - Dogs allowed - WiFi - Washer/dryer (Kr. 800/800)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRINsR9d0FLk9VO4iG2iEHUZBAb7sD7mV6MfB4Wq2AweBo04dWmodQjIavM_ZIJB4DFzBbT6BtJKN_DUJp9J45Lo3eyq89X6tK7eqVof0sWYYZpQaTjEkojjIqwgnk9IsuZBUkFSyXbMl8tfUP0kAjzkFMjTj3geC4_TdsbovdSdUHojoCghlvYR-WYjjpB1_J3TXi9aaUeyo2lL50LDDWfbm8mcSVl8z2BpPzozMQsSOBNX7nVAni_U0o?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/kirkjubaer/

