    <Placemark>
      <name>Langbrók Café/Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/langbrok/ here is a camping site in the heart of the area where the famous saga called “Njálssaga” is said to have occurred. The site is next to Café Langbrók and live music is offered on a regular basis by the house band. A goddess temple is close by and has been ordained. Guests may be allowed into the temple for refreshments and even singing songs together. Open 1 May - 1 October Phone: +354 863 4662 Price: 1000 ISK/adult Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity - Shower - Store access - Restaurant - Dogs allowed - BBQ area - Golf course - Pool/hot tub - Hiking paths - Horse rental - Fishing - WiFi
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQJDA3OmK1vkGxp-RkkNN-MDRjT50SZsZrINWRpZlTnI329H-t-wjUQ5hL7j5D0nmGAm1_weKV422hlzcOd8KNr4DP8uCi9XSG54y3d8MEVN02TbuLWdrWaQ4x_aSrkvreRNoz7FmbGrOxQ0EGWqyd3kCh0M2uSR5kCDwYKCmTgjI58Hzcoz2tAFkwWyRJgvQvUEg11zRPSiFLpIHVF6zVf40zT1yc1NhbiglMrLTRgkL6ww58xzXek5b4?authuser=0&fife=s16383
