    <Placemark>
      <name>Berunes Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/berunes/ Next to the hostel Berunes is a camp site, sheltered with growth. There are two areas, one is for the smaller tents and the other is for the travel campers and mobile homes. A toilet, shower, indoor cooking facilities, electricity and the hostel has various service for the camp site guests. For more information have a look at the website. Open: May 1st - October 15. Phone: 869 7227 Price: Kr. 1800/adult (Free for 12 and younger) Seniors: Kr. 1500 Facilities: - WC - Water - Shower - Electricity (Kr. 800) - Cooking facilities - Hiking paths - Dogs allowed
