    <Placemark>
      <name>Hvammstangi Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/rGk76bKNjnro2NJ78 Hvammstangi is the largest town in Hunathing Vestra, the perfects destination for tourists. It offers a top class swimming pool, shops, a restaurant, museums, galleries and other services. The Kirkjuhvammur camping site in Hvammstangi is only 6 kilometers from the Icelandic Route 1, midway between Reykjavik and Akureyri. The site is located in a sheltered dell just outside the town, equipped with a fully furbished service station and good facilities for campers and trailers. Open: May 15 - November 1st (perhaps longer if weather is good) Phone: +354 899 0008 Adults: Kr. 1.500 Senior citizens: Kr. 1.200 Children: Free for 17 years and younger Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity (Kr. 700) - Playground - Hiking paths - Pool/hot tub - Washing machine (Kr. 400) - Waste disposal - Dogs allowed
