    <Placemark>
      <name>Miðjanes Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/midjanes/ The Miðjanes campsite is only 5 km from Reykhólar and offers nice views and shelter from the Icelandic winds. Open 1 May - 1 October Phone: +354 894 5883 / +354 690 3825 Price: 1500 ISK Free for 0-18 children Facilities: - WC - Water - Electricity 1300 ISK - Washing machine - Shower - Dogs allowed - Picnic tables
