    <Placemark>
      <name>Siglufjörður</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/siglufjordur/ The campsite in Siglufjörður is located in the middle of town and within walking distance to most services. Open: May 15th - October 15th Adults: 1.400 ISK. Senior citizens and the disabled: 1.200 ISK. FREE for 16 years and younger Electricity: 1.200 ISK. Washing machine and dryer: 500 ISK. Pr. wash Campingsite guard: Guðmundur (Gummi) Phone number 663-5560 E-mail.: gistihusjoa@gmail.com
