    <Placemark>
      <name>Ytra lón Farm lodge</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/TYqpYkbLsCxkU87v5 In wintertime they keep their lot open for customers who want to sleep the night. In winter if the weather is quite bad, it can be good to call ahead your arrival. This is a new option and we don't know much about the place, if you stay there please let us know about your experience to haukur@happycampers.is Open: In winter if weather conditions aren't too bad. Price: Unknown Facilities: Unknown but most likely they offer you to use the farm lodge facilities.
