      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/V6v6JAcaRxNPun856 This campsites is only 4km from the beautiful Hengifoss waterfall and you will also find the Kárahnjúkar power station information center there. Good showering and cooking facilities Closed: December-February Phone: 863-5215 Adults: 1.800 kr. Free for 14 years and younger Senior citizens: 1.000 kr Free wifi 4th night free Facilities: - WC - Shower (Included) - Electricity (Kr. 800) - Water - Hiking trails - Fishing - Dogs allowed - Waste disposal
