      <Point>
        <coordinates>-14.973196,65.025558,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Hallormsstaður/Atlavík Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/atlavik/ The forest is a popular area for outdoor life with diverse landscape. There are about 40km of marked walking paths the you can find on a walking path mat. There is a family friendly tree museum with over 80 different types of trees. There is also Hótel Hallormsstaður, a new hotel with 63 rooms and two restaurants. There is also a summer hotel and next to that there is a horse rental. The inlet of Atlavík is beautifully situated on the shores of Lagarfljót (Lögurinn). Like other areas in the Hallormsstaður woodland, the inlet provides the shelter of trees, as well as a comparatively continental climate at the south end of the lake, far away from oceanic conditions. In addition to a 2 full-scale camping site, rental services for small boats, Hallormsstaður also offers the possibility of horse renting. Open mid-May until 1 October Phone: +354 470 2070 Price: Kr. 1700/adult (Free for 14 and younger) Facilities: - WC - Water - Shower (Kr. 500) - Electricity (Kr. 1000) - Playground - Hiking paths - Bike rental - Waste disposal - Horse rental - Restaurant - Dogs allowed
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSPh74ysx0WVjTj0nS8fGcb771svV97TkVr1zJiGd58-eBQSU4vbebdAu-ZtAC4ZCzBG5jyPJBxyDavOJwnxDG4eqstYQ0l9xX_bN-I3Nqp62Dq5QoO-3f53RIlHtAZFItW4bRyuUSRCvE-T63bLp_4RKG2tkZD5M-v4A0D7Nxug93S5r3b5L_fxGvMm8jQj1zMlYpTru8LEWRwr2sZ6_HUoA8OXNfpNFU9TlkrFJT6YwlZjHGt_0vUsxg?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/atlavik/

