      <name>Tjaldsvæði Ólafsfjarðar</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/olafsfjordur/ Open 15. May - 15. October Adults: 1.400 ISK. Senior citizens and the disabled: 1.200 ISK. FREE for 16 years and younger Electricity: 1.200 ISK. Washing machine and dryer: 500 ISK. Pr. wash Campingsite guard: Guðmundur (Gummi) Phone number 663-5560 E-mail.: gistihusjoa@gmail.com
