    <Placemark>
      <name>Álftavötn hut</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.fi.is/en/mountain-huts/all-mountain-huts/alftavatn TENT CAMPING ONLY This hut is a restored farmers' sheep roundup hut, which offers both sleeping bag places in the hut and camping spots. According to their website, it costs kr. 5700/night in the hut or Kr. 2000/night at the campsite per person. This is a very remote and isolated area and extremely beautiful. You will have to hike the last 2-300 meters to the hut, as the jeep track ends before reaching it. Running water and WC are found outside the hut. This can be a convenient stop fore adventurous hikers.
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGScnHHwjD4o6jS-wI7iqE6baYdaxNKJN4D4EKwpZskSj9hkbzdA588BBnbZPwMt5K_R5HDu6yQxO4DClqU8yBwWIenzrLO7qXZHL8F1NJ3k9ysPURITlx1X7C4fXJN3bieMF-x4eXiNK1jO6ekhqddqhwtLgmG7AfuILD-mtZt12f2lV2tehEUgfVIhIQgAG2h9ekIYYrMSmXHGp2NZgkNr3jjYmO0W22pi0wWi-QeEsjIs97cti072A30?authuser=0&fife=s16383
