    <Placemark>
      <name>Básar Hut &amp; campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/basar/ Located in the beautiful area of Þórsmörk, this campsite is a part of the Basar Mountain Huts area. The campsite has facilities during the summertime. - WC - Showers (kr. 500) - Grill Price: Kr. 2000/person, 0-12 yrs free
