    <Placemark>
      <name>Hagavatn Camping</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.fi.is/en/mountain-huts/all-mountain-huts/hagavatn TENT CAMPING ONLY This is a small mountain hut by Hagavatn lake, built in 1942 and rebuilt in 1986. The hut has no running water and is heated with a wood furnace, but you'll find running glacier water nearby and an outhouse. If you are camping outside the hut, please leave Kr. 2.500/person for fees.
