    <Placemark>
      <name>ITA Mounatin Hut Hloduvellir</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.fi.is/en/mountain-huts/all-mountain-huts/hloduvellir This mountain hut is at the southern foot of Mt. Hlöðufell. The hut was built in 1970 and accommodates 15 people. The only running water is collected rainwater but the hut has a gas stove. Only accessible by robust 4x4 vehicles and not recommended for Happy 4x4 campervan. Price: Kr. 2500/person
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRWVgH6nDYZXLMBMqk2BW_qPF32lqw8mkVZJV1SlhfxtBiYBvBIuZ18hldzE-QkHH4-NJLjYwsYDmqO6Gg10fUjE5haUmOqWE4fywWFc60wfJlFH0Y433o3Ghkq22Sz2d_NTtKZo7hlTljXPCpnKXIVEopiWSVi6DjhVO3cZwGwV-kmyZSgARQCtB8TpuT5_EcpQ_ZbT0uh4yv-U9461iU__HYws2u4YQPYayMf2tqTdbTDV3F7EfssC7U?authuser=0&fife=s16383
