      <styleUrl>#style_Campsites___Mountain_Huts</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-20.557222,64.398549,0.0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Hólaskjól-Higlandcenter</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.eldgja.is/en This is another mountain hut campsite with limited (but good) facilities and very remote. Holaskjol is located in Lamskardsholar next to an old lavafield that from when Eldgja erupted, the years 934-940. It is a peaceful and beautful place with just a 5 minute walk up the lavafield to an unnamed waterfall in Sydri-Ofaera, that many call Silfurfoss or Litli-Gullfoss, we like to call it Huldufoss. The lavafield provides a good cover for Holaskjol so there is almost never much wind. Also many hiking trails in the area. The camp site has tables and chairs, toilets and showers. In Hólaskjól there is also sleeping accomodation indoors, sleeping bag accommodations and a few huts that is possible to get with or without bed linen. Adults 2000 kr. 7-17 years 1000 kr Use of cooking and dining facilities inside for day guests: 1,000 kr. Shower: 500 kr. Cabin accommodation: 7000 kr./person
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTRTs_D5F31AqxUQ2zp2zWyXALbJuA_RXV1DJrCnuQV-R5cb2uyPG33YoY0TfkcrhTWRaKDvTWcXh0DgbnV7O9TZO8CBR2P4dh0T-9TBfeuNpVxBpBKNS_BNrCfLHTxqnWLIecgHca8Z_b6piK1vltvuAFgRYNBAiLt-2LL3k4mRXz9WfezNeJcMAN3rjKtWRWdT7Ofo36r6-tlHq1xV798jaeDR4YmnAaXyvUpXz11l-VCvM_bQ8QJiBU?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://www.eldgja.is/en

