    <Placemark>
      <name>Hvitarnes</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.fi.is/en/mountain-huts/all-mountain-huts/view/hvitarnes TENT CAMPING ONLY This is a mountain hut campsite and is not recommended for campervan travelers. It is remote and has very limited facilities. The hut has a log stove and WC in a separate outhouse. The views, however, are amazing. Price: Kr. 2.500/person fi@fi.is Tel.: +354 655-0173
