    <Placemark>
      <name>Jökulheimar Hut</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://nat.is/jokulheimar-huts/ A private hut at the end of F229. The location is very close to the Tungnaa River (fantastic opportunity for drone shots of braided glacial river?) For Booking: http://jorfi.is/?page_id=1275
