    <Placemark>
      <name>Strútur</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/strutur/ MOUNTAIN HUT CAMPSITE This remote campsite is, like all mountain huts, difficult to access and has limited facilities. It is not recommended for campervan travelers. Mountain hut Strutur was built to accommodate 26 people in 2002. Its access track lies just west of Mt Maelifell from the Middle Route. Interesting one day hikes take you to Raudubotnar, River Holmsa Lagoon, Strutslaug and glacier Torfajokull. The hut is an ideal resting place for those who are hiking from Alftavotn to Hvanngil or Emstrur or visa versa. June 15 - August 31 Price: Kr. 2500/person Telephone: +354 562 1000 / +354 641 9201 utivist@utivist.is
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTpPu3z2AieLkhQ4IEOg2IpuJRR12xWHDaDMRMKKLtU-PJcMrBIgS1LQccKjIx-1RW0pS25IGTNBXjoQkZGEcrEUke7eDCoqDicwej139_QEJxc1rxFN0OIanJ2HF68L7cqJn-kwIh0G2Udx-fqfj1DGUDIZ5RQQ0lMxA2E6qNg6B3k6rAgDkk6hyLSk1YYlHpRFLWCM04QKcG3FvH91_-HKbQITtxHSXVlB4byZgcZadI3WL1a14Ej76Y?authuser=0&fife=s16383
