    <Placemark>
      <name>Þorskafjarðarheiði</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/HQCarEVvB1pRqkpA7 Isolated mountain hut -- good for IG photo! :)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGR_qC0wNKrczoE3fyaufXA68etnLHEYImWS1MDrH3wXGdUcr9LHkgNozleEu02YOzsZufFqG9FjRhgtKYhyPHwt9l9VrPThUCNoikSF4bOHS0oE03OeFK7t2g1dUyjhKUMxDzwkxMkgxk_UyNOoB-0CM3aqxkztNSRhx48phindZDfxFZ8zQmR8N8UhQ5yhq_A9t3uCW-Qn0xIExzGhpbsIa8so9kg9BRFqhIcEaeqcwxzW0u02YeQ7Kak?authuser=0&fife=s16383
