    <Placemark>
      <name>Mulaskali mountain hut</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/uyUrraDDBxDowYCt7 in the summer there is a bus from Höfn to Illikambur, located about 40 minutes' walk from the cabin. The cabin has sleeping facilities for thirty people in two separate rooms. The place is equipped with a bathroom, kitchen and cooking facilities. Hikers must bring their own food, sleeping bag or bedding. The cabin is located in the area with a beautiful view of the region, and there are various hiking trails in the surrounding area. For reservations and further information: gonguferdir@gonguferdir.is
