    <Placemark>
      <name>Vardberg</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/LBrHkw5oMJcShBQ26 MOUNTAIN HUT CAMPSITE This remote campsite is, like all mountain huts, difficult to access and has limited facilities. It is not recommended for campervan travelers. A camping site and WCs are in the immediate vicinity of the huts. The summer season starts in June in the lake area south of river Tungnaa. Permits are sold at farm Skard, in the hut at Landmannahellir and in Landmannalaugar. Prior arrangements are not necessary. The season ends on September 20th. Accommodation is on offer at Landmannahellir. During the high season prior arrangements are necessary. Price: N/A
