    <Placemark>
      <name>Volcano Huts Þórsmörk</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/39R6fLP27UNT75Mk9 The Volcano Huts are located in the Thorsmork nature reserve in Iceland, situated in the Husadalur valley, between towering glaciers and volcanoes. The area can best be described as a hikers paradise where you will find endless hiking trails that lead you through beautiful, volcanic landscapes. Here you will experience Icelandic nature at its best and meet interesting people that share your passion for nature and adventure. The Volcano Huts offer accommodation in small cottages, shared cabin-dorms, private bedrooms and camping grounds surrounded by unique volcanic nature. Whether you are travelling by yourself, with your family or with a group, you should find a suitable accommodation at the Volcano Huts. The best way to get here is by bus, as you will have to cross a few big rivers on the way. You can take the bus all the way from Reykjavik or leave your car and hop on board the bus at various stops along the way. Further information on how to get here and bus tickets are available on our website. Daily bus schedule are from Reykjavík during summer: Reykjavik-Thorsmork-Reykjavik For further information and bookings, please visit our website www.volcanohuts.com, or send us an email volcanohuts@volcanohuts.com or call us on +354 552 8300.
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTCJzS5DYjAqXahGhgBWqwBG5HIknsVeGWecuMwk5RdlMHgllI81GmckQ0-D1Z9AQnWLGPPQA8dVNErGgr2ceHOiJc4LkiWoMl8bi-34sr4yRoKj3mPx0IGJvdjuNsDMsKHd_LCXy4wULMQQG2mrq4MEFVWtMi5KuG8QMPkJYzZrjxYA61Ipz-bA_D6gNKm-AQtChdVKydBbby6Y-EARbIdE6SNB0nsyNbeJ2fc_r6yMcZXA7Vj8-RkWyU?authuser=0&fife=s16383
