    <Placemark>
      <name>Cabin at Langisjor</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/S8WVP6WE5CRvRWe39 A surreal place... It's a kinda of place that is hard to believe that it exists and it's on airbnb! Getting there is not easy though -- river crossing is required! A cabin in the middle of nowhere is quite an understatement for this place we stayed (in summer 2018) in the most remote part of the highlands. No electricity and no running water but we had an amazing time staying at this breathtakingly beautiful part of Iceland and very few venture out here! https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/22806300 (seem to be no longer listed on Airbnb -- not sure what's the place is currently used for but it seems you could camp here)
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGQPuGdz4Scc5h4bvVjDL1fhqbvn-jlq4r1_E6g8gIs9QEcjRIXRgkU8i52d01sE_akhdoEI49NC-cLaU5YikqpStvTc65xqf6oQbs6gVhUHeSfPqxbPHYoGnFUrH_9kkqCJdcE4EmRz4VQd0MG7Rbveg2HAb-2CLSdgUO0jCH2r_v0E5tiYla3J4gigRqtxGpaYYEFZ-gFhjPqNPwygg-UCPyJHB1GAgislRZRWeDMf6vLoUUDzmgC0KIg?authuser=0&fife=s16383
