    <Placemark>
      <name>Sigurðarskáli</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://nat.is/hut-sigurdarskali-kverkfjoll/ This is a mountain hut cloest to Kverkfjöll which is an impressive hot spring area on top of the glacier. But very difficult to reach, because it requires a few hundered meters steep climbing on the glacier. A hike from the cabin at the foot of the glacier to the spring area and back will take a full day. There are guided tours that start at the cabin.
