    <Placemark>
      <name>Hunaver Campsite</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/hunaver/ A cozy open camp site close to a small forest. There is a playground and a football field. It is fairly close to Blönduós and Varmahlíð, where more services are available. We haven't been to this campsite ourselves, so any information about it can be sent to thorsteinn(at)happycampers.is. Phone: 452 7110 Facilities: - WC - Showers - Electricity - Playground - Kitchen
