    <Placemark>
      <name>Þverbrekknamúli</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.fi.is/is/skalar/skalar-ferdafelags-islands/thverbrekknamuli MOUNTAIN HUT CAMPSITE This remote campsite is, like all mountain huts, difficult to access and has limited facilities. It is not recommended for campervan travelers. The Thverbrekknamuli hut is situated southeast of Mt Hrutfell, near river Fulakvisl. It is near the middle of the hiking trail on the ancient Kjolur Route. The hut was built in 1980 and accommodates 20 people. The house is heated with gas and an oil-stove. There are no utensils in the house and visitors have to take garbage with them. A WC is near the hut and a latrine for winter travellers a bit further away. The fifth bridge across river Fulakvisl was built in 2005. The others have either been swept away by floods or not withstood the weight of the winter snow. Price: Kr. 2.500/person fi@fi.is Tel.: +354-568 2533
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGSBXAwQHLPvOevMqQ9zs5yQlyP1YxhbxdzGUCYY6TzxK7BbQIhaY0OqGzTw-isusK1riuGRt1cRltGLTKlQiIxeQKxZvoZBrs642kX-B6EJW3TjtEelWFC_v7cLVyhczWdoQczdmQkOPQYnWmgHWPW0j5JJTdEJGaKDrM9RO2byBtJvdKAReYWhcpzC_ZwIgkONdsi9rX0pv3iNzur8hv_illnih4W86Fl4y92xcZ7SySwS13TbLprIL3U?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://www.fi.is/is/skalar/skalar-ferdafelags-islands/thverbrekknamuli

