    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Kerlingarfjöll campsite &amp; huts</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://tjalda.is/en/kerlingarfjoll/ To get to Mountain Kerlingarfjoll you need to drive Kjalveg from the south. Also, if you have 4×4 jeep you can drive to the mountains from Thorsarverum and from Tungvelli in Hrunamannahreppur through Leppistungur. The camping site is located on the banks of the river Asgardsa in the valley Asgardur that is in the northern part of the mountains. The site has showers and a steam bath. The steam bath is located 1km from the camping site. Also there is a playground for the kids. The campsite is large, nesting on natural grounds at the banks of the Ásgarðsá river. Guests staying in the sleeping bag facilities or the camp site have access to a kitchen facilities. Price: Kr. 2.500/person Kitchen access: Kr. 450
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRffH0Mc6tpDmyqUCphvbAZRM1ou3nuON_og_Zl-19JFk0MxqKZY1wWDqHHx3_OShgYnpKDsuV_-C09Ozjn9wErdwEU_RjRG0pyU512vN2UTdFFyz-17qJnBL1aDXpCtYo5YBRowx3KBtaZGZFU-CTeB7SuBVc9Hpc8tpFQ3sUS-glIDJJBgw7Xw4R5MNEgjnpu_3I5mJAwVoqhjWtkELPsBlsb1F1RhSUrXfd7E29EojdPUthYatDpdkY?authuser=0&fife=s16383
https://tjalda.is/en/kerlingarfjoll/

