    <Placemark>
      <name>Laugarfell hut</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/sxwmy3FAUgQGEVkR7 Quaint, clean room and the surroundings can't be beat! Good food. Two hot tubs with naturally warm water from the ground, one is bigger with warm water at a comfortable temperature around 35-37°c and the other is smaller (original/older) with heat at approximately 44°c which. There is an option to pay to use the pool and shower if you aren't guests here.
