    <Placemark>
      <name>Ósvör Museum</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/XRAHhjTyrhnrEpTy5 Ósvör is replica of an old Icelandic fishing station, from the19th century. On display are a rowing boat, a crew hut with tools and equipment, a salt house and a drying shed. The curator welcomes guests in a traditional fisherman outfit.
