      <name>Aquarium &amp; Natural History Museum</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/r4jtzoXMJ1HfCRxc9 The “Fish and Natural History Museum of Vestmannaeyjar” was opened in 1964 and is the oldest museum of its kind in the country. The museum was run by the town of Vestmannaeyjar until January 2010 when the Research Center of Vestmannaeyjar took over the management. It is now simply called “The Aquarium.”
