      <name>Eldheimar museum</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://www.eldheimar.is/?lang=en THE DRAMATIC VOLCANIC ERUPTION OF VESTMANNAEYJAR! The eruption 1973 forced the entire population, of over 5000 people, to evacuate the island on a moment´s notice in the middle of the night. Many of them lost their homes and belongings, some never returned to Heimaey.
