    <Placemark>
      <name>Puffins Papey</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/msMuT5GrMvMTSEfK7 Papey Island lies just offshore, close to the small town of Djupivogur. Overrun with all kinds of sea birds and seals, this small island is also home to Iceland's oldest wooden church.
