      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/49ZCsH2RZG4Zw8xW6 While there is no direct way of going in search of puffins here, if you are catching the ferry between Stykkishólmur and the Westfjords, you'll likely see some of the little birds on some of the many small islands that you'll be sailing past.
