      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/Les1qfSjKYEjrwko8 Iceland´s only territory in the Arctic Circle, a day trip to Grimsey Island during the summer will give you 24 hours of sunlight and a never-ending chorus of bird cries, as they far outnumber the local population of Icelanders.
