      <name>Puffins Skoruvíkurbjarg</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/MrAEmNbLKap37kAU6 Another of Iceland's unknown and isolated areas, the northeast probably sees the least amount of tourism of the whole country. The cliffs on this remote peninsula are only accessed by hiking through.
