    <Placemark>
      <name>Puffins Ingólfshöfði</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/rkkvojnuohM33N5T8 Accessed only by a tour offered from the families who own the farms in the area, getting here is an adventure in itself. You'll bump along in a tractor across rivers and a vast expanse of black sand before reaching this isolated outpost of green.
