    <Placemark>
      <name>Ice Beach (West side)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/vfUx52Zzej1RpQsR9 Amazing black sand beach where the icebergs from the glacier lagoon wash ashore. Check both beaches (East and West) as the amount of Icebergs can be varied. Sunset/Sunrise is a great time to photograph if the sun comes out (not often though)
