    <Placemark>
      <name>Svínafellsjökull</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://epiciceland.net/winter-itinerary-south-iceland/#Svinafellsjokull_glacier https://goo.gl/maps/fEs4eseyN1dHMR4M9 dubbed hollywood glacier as a lot of movies were filmed here! There are no facilities at this stop and the road is very bumpy, but if you go very, very slowly and strategically most cars should be able to make it to the parking lot. Then you are only a few steps from a great view. you can walk along the cliff to get closer to the glacier and the views get better and better. The glacier is less "dirty" comparing to other spots in Iceland. Allocate 30 min - 2 hours here.
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGTSY_GiewdWua13S5Hr8nxya1fg0Dj2pP-11FKJSSXnlCX39PKPSi7x_i5IFn2INW-wpcdTUTjc4nis5ChcSddpri09IvJo7HHI32TJc-Ec8RhRk5ctN1hw8Z2nN6GBqvocCqVA9acK1QT1Vb-_Q9Q2Ztzri-m7nY3CcqFqSdLzyWCRW0eYjkuntdbmx2DzqOKMh3reZ2uw-qSoSqwPmuYjVjW_45Di6K-gIkLDOfNtUoWBPhZtTWhdgu8?authuser=0&fife=s16383
