    <Placemark>
      <name>Lækjavík Coast</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/F9TH5nLvmUn8pbQMA Steep cliffs and mountains dropping dramatically down the ocean below, endless rocky coastline and some sea stacks -- one of the most scenic Iceland coastline.
