    <Placemark>
      <name>Laugavegur trek</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Wow Factor : 5/5 Named top hikes in the world by National Geographic! The legendary laugavegur hikes starts here! It takes about 4 days to complete it. The other day hikes also starts here. http://frugalfrolicker.com/iceland-laugavegur-trek/
