    <Placemark>
      <name>Gjáin-Stöng Hike</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://epiciceland.net/best-places-in-highlands-iceland/#23_Gjain https://goo.gl/maps/abpgDvm7UgPbmEVh7 Hike from ruins of a real Viking settlement farm, (Stöng) to Gjain. Wonderful short hike (1 hour). Alternatively, you can just park at Gjain if you only plan to visit Gjain. Opens in summer only when road is open. 4WD recommended to get here (bumpy road) http://www.wikiloc.com/wikiloc/view.do?id=10788010 Read more about Stong here : https://guidetoiceland.is/connect-with-locals/regina/stong--the-ruins-of-a-real-viking-settlement-manor
