      <name>Borgarvirki</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/1FcZNXpwa5ivnMWM9 Situated on a strategic high ground, this natural rock formation/structure was once used as a military fortress. A "must stop" during a drive around Vatnsnes Peninsular, and just a short drive from/to Hvitserkur
