    <Placemark>
      <name>Ofeigisfjörður</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/fo8ht37jYVbZRMtn6 Very nice and remote area! Continuing from INGÓLFSFJÖRÐUR, the road goes on for a kilometer or two more from Ofeigisfjörður, but there is a river you must cross that probably is a bit big for a Forester most of the time. We really liked this area, very remote, basically did not meet a single car in over four hours.
