    <Placemark>
      <name>Surtshellir</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/g6kGrEB3gD6JNbJN6 Beautiful lava tube cave (Explore on your own). The path is well marked and relatively level. The caves were great. But bring a head lamp if you want to go very far in. 4x4 recommended but may not needed in summer.
https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AKcrxGRM4FT1LFLDLVnqCQYSMoa24kqFYvi5nQPnRTuNHX5JcwKFL-DIszfalrVdq0TC_B4yX2KFqPFg6wPiivafdQ4WxM1FItdeCsq2dlXqhCY2VAQtT_NYqVgv6rga2deZTkj_LilM42_xajfBygSIIiXTTlgIsSveJfdWoY2DfTkGkXFNUeYmCthr8XhRQdiUJ75wwPJ_OFb5jwxchd8ZjA_w50lkVpiqxAmz3ZWSx-8MO08XtyhlYR5Xu5k?authuser=0&fife=s16383
