      <name>Svörtuloft Lighthouse</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/rggLGwgfcUPbpxpF7 the best viewpoint in the entire national park. On a sunny day, be sure to get there when the sun is setting as it will show you the most amazing lightshow you’ve seen in Iceland, well, definitely a close second to an aurora-filled night, though!
