      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/5zpC65L4DvHWraa76 Fascinating trip around a tunnel network inside a glacier. The journey there and back from Husafell in a bus created on the chassis of a NATO missile launcher was an experience in itself as the bus lurched and tilted it's way through the soft snow to climb the glacier.
