      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/gb8TPppA8Nj1zKE67 https://goo.gl/maps/8ZTWBdp86z93L6bA8 Hoffellsjökull is one of the closest glacier tongues to Höfn, located approximately 25 km from the town. There are some nice, short walks and longer hiking trails in the area, with excellent panoramic views over this glacier tongue, which calves into a small lake.
