      <name>Parking for Studlagil Canyon Hike</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/dxw1T5DtmNPGvwVD8 Update July 2021: You can drive across the bridge and park at another parking lot (not shown on this map) which is closer (save you 1 hour of walking!) Recommended time to visit: spring/ early summer (the water may not be that blue if you visit other times). Early morning is the best for photography. The hike is about 4 km one-way. The whole trip will take a few hours. look for accommodation nearby. From the closer parking lot, it's 2 km one-way and the whole trip will take The allows you get to the bottom of the canyon which is not possible from the west side.
