    <Placemark>
      <name>Hike to Canyon Baths</name>
      <description><![CDATA[a splendid opportunity to bathe in a hot spring in the same way as the Vikings and medieval chieftains did a thousand years ago. You may not get an overpriced souvenir for it, but the memories will stay with you forever. https://grapevine.is/travel/2020/01/14/soaking-in-love-a-relaxing-time-in-the-husafell-canyon-baths/ https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/husafell-giljabod-husafell-canyonbaths-77462653
