    <Placemark>
      <name>Eyrarbakki</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/aWv45FEiTqBQ7Ynb8 Nowadays Eyrarbakki is so quiet, yet with so much to offer. If you love quaint old colourful houses and a slow pace of life, then Eyrarbakki is the place to visit :)
