      <name>Abandoned Barn Fossfjörður</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/ufyMY3LwCvZHAi197 In Fossfjörður you will also stumble up on the so called A-house, wich has been a popular pitstop among travellers and photographers. This abandoned house is unique for its shape and location.
