    <Placemark>
      <name>Eldhraun Lava Field parking</name>
      <description><![CDATA[https://goo.gl/maps/eL7Fyj7R7KKBfdST8 Iceland's volcanic origins are on display throughout the country; one striking example of this volcanic past and present are the ubiquitous moss-covered lava rocks. There are great sections of moss covered lava rocks for several km long along this section of road, this is just a parking spot! Park here and walk around -- do not step on the moss, please!
