      <name>Filming Location: Svínafellsjökull</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Interstellar (2014) Cooper (Matthew McConaughey), Brand (Anne Hathaway) and Romilly (David Gyasi) land on an ice planet to find Mann (Matt Damon) who had landed there years before. Game of Thrones (2012, 2013) Series 2 Episodes 6 and 7 Jon Snow (Kit Harington) and several others from the "Knights Watch" find a "wildling" girl, Ygritte (Rose Leslie), and plan to kill her. Ygritte escapes and Jon tracks her down and eventually catches her. They find Ygritt a few meters from the parking lot. The other scenes are taken at or on Svínafellsjökli. Batman Begins (2005) League of Shadows set in the Himalayas where Bruce Wayne (Christian Bale) becomes the apprentice of Ra's Al Ghul (Liam Neeson). Wayne walks through a small village on his way up the mountain. The village was built right next to the parking lot and the entrance to the temple was just around the corner. Most of the temple (all but the entrance) is a model that was spliced with the environment in post-production. He also battles Al Ghul on the frozen lagoon.

